7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Koji: "I mean, she'd seriously never gone skating before I took her the other day."

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Oumi: "Hey! Is it really that strange?"

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
