Fuminori: "......Okay."

1204
02:13:25,000 --> 02:13:28,000
*I'd started to suspect that it might be so.*

1205
02:13:28,000 --> 02:13:36,000
*In the hell my eyes had made of the world, Saya alone had looked normal. I'd thought that she was somehow unique.*

1206
02:13:36,000 --> 02:13:51,000
*In truth, however, she had probably been a different kind of "unique" than I'd imagined. It wasn't that my senses hadn't distorted her appearance, but that she had been so unusual as to seem normal to my twisted mind.*

1207
02:13:51,000 --> 02:13:58,000
*Saya's true form was something other than what I had known. Now, however, I could see her as she really was.*

1208
02:13:58,000 --> 02:14:08,000
*But Saya didn't want that, and it was not for me to question the workings of her heart. I just had to accept that girls need to keep some things private.*

1209
02:14:08,000 --> 02:14:13,000
Fuminori: "I tried to say something to you that day. Do you remember?"

1210
02:14:13,000 --> 02:14:15,000
*I slid the phone back to her.*

1211
02:14:15,000 --> 02:14:21,000
*I smiled wryly at the text on the screen, wondering if she really thought me so heartless.*

1212
02:14:21,000 --> 02:14:23,000
Fuminori: "How could I forget?"

1213
02:14:23,000 --> 02:14:32,000
*No one was listening, but still -- it would have been embarassing to speak the rest aloud, so this time I typed it into the phone.*

1214
02:14:32,000 --> 02:14:33,000
*G, H, I*

1215
02:14:33,000 --> 02:14:34,000
*j, k, l*

1216
02:14:34,000 --> 02:14:35,000
*m, n, o*

1217
02:14:35,000 --> 02:14:36,000
*t, u, v*

1218
02:14:36,000 --> 02:14:37,000
*d, e*

1219
02:14:37,000 --> 02:14:38,000
*w, x, y*

1220
02:14:38,000 --> 02:14:39,000
*m, n, o*

1221
02:14:39,000 --> 02:14:40,000
*t, u*

1222
02:14:40,000 --> 02:14:43,000
*I slid the phone back through the slot.*

1223
02:14:43,000 --> 02:14:46,000
*I could sense her trembling outside my door.*

1224
02:14:46,000 --> 02:14:51,000
*I couldn't see her, or hear her -- but still, I knew. Saya was crying.*

1225
02:14:51,000 --> 02:14:53,000
Fuminori: "I was ready, you know."

1226
02:14:53,000 --> 02:14:57,000
*Perhaps my words offered no comfort, spoken so late.*

1227
02:14:57,000 --> 02:14:59,000
*Even so... I was ready.*

1228
02:14:59,000 --> 02:15:13,000
*I had wanted to return to my old life, true, but I would have abandoned that wish for Saya. I know that I would have gone with her, hand-in-hand, as far as we could -- even to the most forbidden of places.*

1229
02:15:13,000 --> 02:15:25,000
*Saya, too, must have known that I was prepared -- and because she knew, she stopped me from saying those words. If I had spoken that oath, there would have been no going back.*

1230
02:15:25,000 --> 02:15:28,000
*Seeing the words on the screen, I shook my head.*

1231
02:15:28,000 --> 02:15:36,000
Fuminori: "It's not your fault. If I hadn't hesitated, you would have found the courage." you were changing because of me."

1232
02:15:36,000 --> 02:15:38,000
Fuminori: "It's no one's fault."

1233
02:15:38,000 --> 02:15:46,000
*Saya couldn't bring herself to take everything from me, and I couldn't bring myself to give up everything for her.*

1234
02:15:46,000 --> 02:15:48,000
*We were too weak to find happiness.*

1235
02:15:48,000 --> 02:15:55,000
Fuminori: "What will you do now, Saya?" dad. He'll know how to send me back to where I came from."

1236
02:15:55,000 --> 02:15:59,000
Fuminori: "I see. You do want to go home, don't you?"

1237
02:15:59,000 --> 02:16:09,000
*A short time passed with no words or messages exchanged. I wonder how many times in that brief silence "yes" and "no" changed places in her mind.*

1238
02:16:09,000 --> 02:16:15,000
*When the phone finally returned, the characters on the screen seemed strangely uncertain.*

1239
02:16:15,000 --> 02:16:18,000
Fuminori: "Well, I hope you find your father."

1240
02:16:18,000 --> 02:16:26,000
*The time had come for our parting. She had chosen her path, and I had given my blessing. There was nothing more to be said.*

1241
02:16:26,000 --> 02:16:32,000
Fuminori: "If you change your mind, I'll always be here. You can come see me whenever you want."

1242
02:16:32,000 --> 02:16:33,000
*Goodbye, Fuminori."*

1243
02:16:33,000 --> 02:16:38,000
*I read her final message and returned the phone to the other side.*

1244
02:16:38,000 --> 02:16:40,000
Fuminori: "Goodbye, Saya."

1245
02:16:40,000 --> 02:16:47,000
*She gently slapped my door in response, and then I heard the sound of her sliding off down the hallway.*

1246
02:16:47,000 --> 02:16:50,000
*And I was left alone in the silence of the night.*

1247
02:16:50,000 --> 02:16:53,000
*Ever since that day, I have been waiting.*

1248
02:16:53,000 --> 02:16:57,000
*Perhaps Saya really did return to where she came from.*

1249
02:16:57,000 --> 02:17:01,000
*Perhaps she is still wandering today, looking for her father.*

1250
02:17:01,000 --> 02:17:14,000
*It must be hard. She must be lonely. When she can no longer stand being alone, she will surely return to me. I am the only one who will comfort her, and whisper sweet nothings in her ear.*

1251
02:17:14,000 --> 02:17:18,000
*And so I wait. Dreaming of her face and her voice, I wait.*

1252
02:17:18,000 --> 02:17:20,000
*Forever, in my white world.*

1253
02:17:20,000 --> 02:17:27,000
*On that terrible day when I first opened my eyes after the accident, what would my answer have been?*

1254
02:17:27,000 --> 02:17:34,000
*When I think back on this many years from now, will I wish that my answer today had been different?*

1255
02:17:34,000 --> 02:17:39,000
*It doesn't matter. Here, at this moment, there is no doubt in my mind.*

1256
02:17:39,000 --> 02:17:45,000
Fuminori: "Who was that?" I ask Saya, looking at the unidentifiable pieces of the monster.

1257
02:17:45,000 --> 02:17:49,000
Saya: "......The man living next door. I don't know his name."

1258
02:17:49,000 --> 02:17:51,000
Fuminori: "Oh, so it was Mr. Suzumi."

1259
02:17:51,000 --> 02:18:01,000
*He was hardly a stranger. We've been neighbors for as long as I can remember. I'd go so far as to say we were on good terms before the accident.*

1260
02:18:01,000 --> 02:18:04,000
*And now I've killed him with my own two hands.*

1261
02:18:04,000 --> 02:18:05,000
*I feel little.*

1262
02:18:05,000 --> 02:18:10,000
*Mr. Suzumi, the kindly painter who lived next door, is but a distant memory.*

1263
02:18:10,000 --> 02:18:19,000
*The pieces of meat around me belonged to a creature whose mere existence was nauseating. Only by killing the vermin could I find relief.*

1264
02:18:19,000 --> 02:18:27,000
*He complained about my yard being filthy, the swine. It doesn't matter what Saya did. He wasn't worth keeping alive anyway.*

1265
02:18:27,000 --> 02:18:29,000
*These are my honest feelings.*

1266
02:18:29,000 --> 02:18:34,000
*My hands are wet with another man's blood, and yet I am utterly calm.*

1267
02:18:34,000 --> 02:18:45,000
*Now I know what I lost in the accident. Saya says that I can take it back, but I know that I cannot. It is gone forever, like the life of the man called Suzumi.*

1268
02:18:45,000 --> 02:18:50,000
Fuminori: "Hey, Saya... No doctor could possibly fix my condition, you know."

1269
02:18:50,000 --> 02:18:52,000
Saya: "......Fuminori?"

1270
02:18:52,000 --> 02:18:57,000
Fuminori: "You can do what no human is capable of. You're not human, are you?"

1271
02:18:57,000 --> 02:18:58,000
Saya: "......"

1272
02:18:58,000 --> 02:19:01,000
*Saya looks away, her expression unreadable.*

1273
02:19:01,000 --> 02:19:09,000
*Everything is monstrous and loathsome in my eyes -- everything but Saya. I thought that she was somehow unique.*

1274
02:19:09,000 --> 02:19:16,000
*I was wrong. I see her just as I do everything else -- as something other than what she really is.*

1275
02:19:16,000 --> 02:19:24,000
*But why should that surprise me? Saya is part of my world, just as I am of hers. It doesn't change what we are to each other.*

1276
02:19:24,000 --> 02:19:28,000
*I stand and walk over to Suzumi's dismembered corpse.*

1277
02:19:28,000 --> 02:19:38,000
Fuminori: "I read this manga once, about a man who recovered from an accident only to find that he could no longer see the world as it was. Kind of like me."

1278
02:19:38,000 --> 02:19:50,000
*I finally realize that even though the stench of these monsters' flesh turns my stomach, their blood and guts smell pretty good. In fact, I know this fragrance quite well.*

1279
02:19:50,000 --> 02:19:59,000
Fuminori: "He saw people as rocks and robots as beautiful women. And so he fell in love with something that wasn't remotely human."

1280
02:19:59,000 --> 02:20:06,000
*I retrieve the cleaver, pick up a piece of Suzumi's body, and start removing the skin and tendons.*

1281
02:20:06,000 --> 02:20:08,000
*Ahh, just as I thought.*

1282
02:20:08,000 --> 02:20:13,000
*The stuff underneath is exactly the same as what Saya and I have been eating.*

1283
02:20:13,000 --> 02:20:17,000
Fuminori: "Hey, this looks pretty good. Let's eat it."

1284
02:20:17,000 --> 02:20:18,000
Saya: "Fuminori..."

1285
02:20:18,000 --> 02:20:29,000
Fuminori: "Oh, sorry. You're in no mood for that now, are you? Now that it's dead, though, meat is meat. It'd be a waste to throw it away. We should get it in the fridge."

1286
02:20:29,000 --> 02:20:31,000
Saya: "Is that... alright with you?"

1287
02:20:31,000 --> 02:20:47,000
Fuminori: "Sure," I answer easily. There is no longer any room for doubt in my mind. "Also, his wife and daughter are probably next door. They might cause trouble when he doesn't come home. We'd better hunt them down before they go to the police."

1288
02:20:47,000 --> 02:20:54,000
Saya: "Is that... really what you want?" Saya asks again, this time with a trace of fear in her voice.

1289
02:20:54,000 --> 02:20:58,000
*I guess I still haven't convinced her of my sincerity.*

1290
02:20:58,000 --> 02:21:09,000
Fuminori: "So at the end of this manga, the man who fell for something inhuman gives up his own humanity for the sake of their love. A happy ending, don't you think?"

1291
02:21:09,000 --> 02:21:10,000
Saya: "Fuminori..."

1292
02:21:10,000 --> 02:21:16,000
Fuminori: "You're all I need now, Saya. Nothing else matters as long as we're together."

1293
02:21:16,000 --> 02:21:21,000
*Tossing the knife and meat aside, I pull Saya into my arms once more.*

1294
02:21:21,000 --> 02:21:25,000
Fuminori: "I can say it now, can't I? Saya... I love you."

1295
02:21:25,000 --> 02:21:32,000
*As Saya wipes away the tears flowing from her eyes, I can no longer see any hint of fear in her face.*

1296
02:21:32,000 --> 02:21:36,000
Saya: "I don't want you to regret this. I don't, but..."

1297
02:21:36,000 --> 02:21:44,000
*I have sworn my oath, and Saya has accepted it. We have nothing to fear now. Saya will never need to cry again.*

1298
02:21:44,000 --> 02:21:49,000
Saya: "I can't help it. I'm so happy. I guess I'm pretty selfish, aren't I?"

1299
02:21:49,000 --> 02:21:54,000
Fuminori: "I don't mind. I'll always indulge your selfishness, Saya."

1300
02:21:54,000 --> 02:22:00,000
*Filled with contentment, we exchange a smile and set to the task of cleaning the room.*

1301
02:22:00,000 --> 02:22:09,000
*A single person produces a lot more meat than I expected. Speaking of which, I seem to remember doing something similar before.*

1302
02:22:09,000 --> 02:22:15,000
Saya: "About his wife and daughter... I think he killed them. I heard their screams."

1303
02:22:15,000 --> 02:22:18,000
Fuminori: "Well, that makes things easier."

1304
02:22:18,000 --> 02:22:30,000
*After we finish here, we should go gather the meat from the Suzumi house. That should be enough to hold us for a while, and we can use their refigerator to store what won't fit in ours.*

1305
02:22:30,000 --> 02:22:34,000
*It's all coming together. Saya and I will be just fine.*

1306
02:22:34,000 --> 02:22:37,000
Saya: "I think I recognize this picture."

1307
02:22:37,000 --> 02:22:43,000
*After we finish our labors and get into bed, I show Saya what I found in Ogai's house.*

1308
02:22:43,000 --> 02:22:47,000
Saya: "It looks familiar. Yeah, I've definitely been there."

1309
02:22:47,000 --> 02:22:53,000
*The photograph that Saya has selected is the one with a Tochigi Prefecture address on the back.*

1310
02:22:53,000 --> 02:22:57,000
Fuminori: "That's... a house, right? I see trees and... mountains?"

1311
02:22:57,000 --> 02:23:01,000
Saya: "Yeah. Wow, Fuminori, you can see pictures now?"

1312
02:23:01,000 --> 02:23:02,000
Fuminori: "A little."

1313
02:23:02,000 --> 02:23:18,000
*At the outset of my ordeal, I had to depend entirely on my sense of distance to decipher what I saw. The houses in front of me, the mountains far behind them, the clouds high above -- only distance and scale told me what they were.*

1314
02:23:18,000 --> 02:23:36,000
*Photographs and other flat images used to be nearly impossible to make out. Recently, however, I've gotten better at understanding what things are by their shape. I know what the mountains and sky look like, for instance, and how to tell them apart from buildings.*

1315
02:23:36,000 --> 02:23:43,000
*Each of the three pictures shows a similar scene -- a lone house in the middle of a thick forest.*

1316
02:23:43,000 --> 02:23:48,000
Saya: "Dad called it his retreat. He said that no one would find us there."

1317
02:23:48,000 --> 02:23:49,000
Fuminori: "Hmm..."

1318
02:23:49,000 --> 02:23:57,000
*Judging by the address on the back of each photo, they probably are excellent places to hide from prying eyes. But why three?*

1319
02:23:57,000 --> 02:24:09,000
*The dates are pretty old, and it seems odd that they were all taken within a few days of each other. Maybe he was scouting properties, looking for the perfect location for his hideaway.*

1320
02:24:09,000 --> 02:24:22,000
*Saya recognizes only one of the houses, so that must be the one Ogai picked. Checking the location on a roadmap of the Kanto area, I find that it's about three hours out of Tokyo by car.*

1321
02:24:22,000 --> 02:24:25,000
Fuminori: "Do you think your father will be there?"

1322
02:24:25,000 --> 02:24:30,000
Saya: "I tried calling him, but he didn't answer. I don't think he's there."

1323
02:24:30,000 --> 02:24:33,000
Fuminori: "But he might have stopped by recently."

1324
02:24:33,000 --> 02:24:46,000
*The way I see it, our only hope of finding Ogai is to follow whatever lead we have, no matter how small. The probability that his hideout will yield useful information may be low... but it's not zero.*

1325
02:24:46,000 --> 02:24:50,000
Fuminori: "I think I'll check this place out tomorrow."

1326
02:24:50,000 --> 02:24:56,000
Saya: "Do you have to?" Saya pouts. I wasn't expecting her to object. "Isn't it far?"

1327
02:24:56,000 --> 02:25:02,000
Fuminori: "It'll only take about half a day to go there, check it out, and come back."

1328
02:25:02,000 --> 02:25:06,000
Saya: "I have to stay home by myself while you're gone?"

1329
02:25:06,000 --> 02:25:11,000
*So that's what it is. Slightly exasperated, I smile and rub Saya's head.*

1330
02:25:11,000 --> 02:25:17,000
Fuminori: "Be a little patient, okay? You want to find your father too, don't you?"

1331
02:25:17,000 --> 02:25:18,000
Saya: "......"

1332
02:25:18,000 --> 02:25:28,000
*After a brief silence, during which her expression is hard to decipher, Saya looks up at me and says, "Hey, Fuminori... let's forget about Dad."*

1333
02:25:28,000 --> 02:25:29,000
Fuminori: "Huh?"

1334
02:25:29,000 --> 02:25:32,000
*That's the last thing I expected her to say.*

1335
02:25:32,000 --> 02:25:37,000
Fuminori: "Forget about him? But he's your father. Aren't you worried?"

1336
02:25:37,000 --> 02:25:42,000
Saya: "Not anymore," Saya says, coming closer to feel my warmth. "I have you now."

1337
02:25:42,000 --> 02:25:52,000
Saya: "I call him Dad, but he's not really my father. He taught me a lot, and probably loved me in his own way... but you're kinder and warmer."

1338
02:25:52,000 --> 02:25:57,000
*Saya's words make me happy, but I also hear the loneliness in them.*

1339
02:25:57,000 --> 02:26:00,000
Fuminori: "Are you really alright with that?"

1340
02:26:00,000 --> 02:26:04,000
Saya: "Yeah. You don't like it being just the two of us?"

1341
02:26:04,000 --> 02:26:19,000
Fuminori: "I do... but I also want to meet Dr. Ogai." Having finally figured out how to explain my feelings, I continue, "I want to get to know you better. If there's someone who knows more about you than I do, I have to meet them."

1342
02:26:19,000 --> 02:26:20,000
Saya: "Oh..."

1343
02:26:20,000 --> 02:26:27,000
*Saya doesn't seem upset, but she does tilt her head quizzically, as though my thoughts are strange to her.*

1344
02:26:27,000 --> 02:26:32,000
Fuminori: "And I also want to... Yeah, I'm going to check it out tomorrow."

1345
02:26:32,000 --> 02:26:38,000
*Another plan has started to form in my head, one separate from the search for Dr. Ogai.*

1346
02:26:38,000 --> 02:26:46,000
*If I find the doctor there, great; if I don't, well... I think I can find another use for his mountain retreat.*

1347
02:26:46,000 --> 02:26:51,000
Fuminori: "I know you'll be lonely, Saya, but try to bear it for a little while."

1348
02:26:51,000 --> 02:27:02,000
Saya: "Okay," she nods, then looks questioningly into my eyes. "Fuminori... You really want a family and friends, don't you? More people you can spend time with?"

1349
02:27:02,000 --> 02:27:15,000
Fuminori: "Well, that would be more fun, yeah..." Fearing that Saya will start sulking, I hurriedly add, "But don't get me wrong. Even if I could have lots of friends, you'll always be special to me."

1350
02:27:15,000 --> 02:27:20,000
Saya: "I know. Hehehe, thanks." Giggling, Saya rubs her cheek against mine.

1351
02:27:20,000 --> 02:27:21,000
Saya:

1352
02:27:21,000 --> 02:27:24,000
*Today, all of Koji's classes were in the morning.*

1353
02:27:24,000 --> 02:27:32,000
*On his way to meet Yoh for lunch after his final lecture, Koji suddenly gets a call in the middle of the hallway.*

1354
02:27:32,000 --> 02:27:51,000
*Without thinking, he reaches to his belt for his new camera-phone, but curses when he realizes that the ringtone is coming from the old phone in his bag. He hasn't transferred his contacts list yet, and calls still come to his old phone from people who don't know the new number.*

1355
02:27:51,000 --> 02:27:58,000
*When he finally fishes the phone from his bag, the name he sees on the display sends a chill up his spine.*

1356
02:27:58,000 --> 02:27:59,000
*Fuminori.*

1357
02:27:59,000 --> 02:28:01,000
*Why now? What does he want?*

1358
02:28:01,000 --> 02:28:07,000
*It's hard to be happy about a call from Fuminori after the incident at the Ogai house.*

1359
02:28:07,000 --> 02:28:08,000
Koji: "Hello?"

1360
02:28:08,000 --> 02:28:12,000
Fuminori: "Hey, Koji. You're done with class for today, right?"

1361
02:28:12,000 --> 02:28:13,000
Koji: "......Yeah."

1362
02:28:13,000 --> 02:28:18,000
*Of course Fuminori would know that Koji is free on Thursday afternoons.*

1363
02:28:18,000 --> 02:28:24,000
Fuminori: "I need to talk to you about something. Can you come to the parking lot?"

1364
02:28:24,000 --> 02:28:25,000
Koji: "Now?"

1365
02:28:25,000 --> 02:28:27,000
Fuminori: "Yeah, I'll be waiting."

1366
02:28:27,000 --> 02:28:30,000
*Fuminori hangs up without another word.*

1367
02:28:30,000 --> 02:28:37,000
*What's gotten into him? What does he want? Koji wonders as he sticks the phone into his jacket pocket.*

1368
02:28:37,000 --> 02:28:43,000
*This sudden change is disturbing after a week of Fuminori avoiding both Koji and Yoh.*

1369
02:28:43,000 --> 02:28:50,000
*Maybe he's finally ready to talk -- in which case, Koji should probably consider this a good thing.*

1370
02:28:50,000 --> 02:28:54,000
*However, he can't shake the feeling that something is wrong.*

1371
02:28:54,000 --> 02:28:56,000
Koji: "Did I keep you waiting?"

1372
02:28:56,000 --> 02:28:57,000
Fuminori: "Nah."

1373
02:28:57,000 --> 02:29:03,000
*In the parking lot, Koji finds Fuminori leaning against the fender of Koji's Accord.*

1374
02:29:03,000 --> 02:29:18,000
*The last time they met was in the darkness of an abandoned house. This is the first time in over a week that they've spoken face-to-face in the light. Perhaps that is why Koji senses something strange in Fuminori's expression.*

1375
02:29:18,000 --> 02:29:22,000
*He's not sure what, exactly, but something has changed.*

1376
02:29:22,000 --> 02:29:28,000
Fuminori: "I think I told you before that I'm looking for information on a man named Ogai."

1377
02:29:28,000 --> 02:29:30,000
Koji: "Yeah, I got that."

1378
02:29:30,000 --> 02:29:37,000
Fuminori: "Well, it's starting to get more complicated. It looks like I can't handle it by myself after all."

1379
02:29:37,000 --> 02:29:50,000
*Fuminori seems more relaxed than before. He used to be tense all the time, like he was terrified of something, but now his expression is calm. He's even wearing what resembles a sheepish grin.*

1380
02:29:50,000 --> 02:29:52,000
Fuminori: "I need your help, Koji."

1381
02:29:52,000 --> 02:29:58,000
*Nevertheless, some instinct is telling Koji that Fuminori's changes are not for the better.*

1382
02:29:58,000 --> 02:30:05,000
Koji: "Why the sudden change of heart?" Koji asks, keeping his expression neutral to conceal his suspicion.

1383
02:30:05,000 --> 02:30:22,000
Fuminori: "You're interested, aren't you?" Fuminori responds coolly. His smile, unreadable as ever, offers no glimpse of his true motives. "You searched Dr. Ogai's house after me. It's a waste of time for us to look for him separately. We should team up."

1384
02:30:22,000 --> 02:30:23,000
Koji: "......"

1385
02:30:23,000 --> 02:30:29,000
