2384
04:25:09,000 --> 04:25:23,000
*We can travel light and take the Suzumi family car. I'd better withdraw everything that's left in my bank account and carry it as cash. I'll also need a weapon, something more reliable than a butcher's knife.*

2385
04:25:23,000 --> 04:25:42,000
*Koji will most likely follow. He thinks that Yoh can still be saved. However, I'm not abandoning this house just to run away. As long as Koji knows our location, we're stuck on the defensive. Leaving gives me the chance to regain the initiative and deal with him at a place of my choosing.*

2386
04:25:42,000 --> 04:25:50,000
*The next time we meet, I'll kill him with my own two hands. I'll make sure to wring every last drop of life out of his body.*

2387
04:25:50,000 --> 04:25:57,000
*A shiver runs through me as I anticipate the battle ahead, and my bloodlust burns like orgasmic fire.*

2388
04:25:57,000 --> 04:26:02,000
*When Ryoko looks up, the morning sun is already streaming in through the window.*

2389
04:26:02,000 --> 04:26:08,000
*Tired from hours of poring over files, she removes her glasses and massages her aching eyes.*

2390
04:26:08,000 --> 04:26:20,000
*Her dreams are always filled with horror, yet the night she just spent was more nightmarish than them all -- and it's not over yet. She has only just set foot on the threshold.*

2391
04:26:20,000 --> 04:26:27,000
*As expected, the files left by Ogai Masahiko were not the sort that Ryoko could simply pick up and read.*

2392
04:26:27,000 --> 04:26:39,000
*Fortunately, Ogai had been too old-fashioned to put his trust in electronic media. If he'd encrypted his files on a computer, she'd have had to find a hacker to decipher them.*

2393
04:26:39,000 --> 04:26:50,000
*In fact, he had not employed any kind of code in his writing. That would have been too time-consuming by hand. The method of obfuscation he did use was quite simple.*

2394
04:26:50,000 --> 04:27:07,000
*Of the files Ryoko pulled from his underground lab, the majority turned out to be notes and theses from Ogai's days as a student. The important papers were the diaries and research notes that had been scattered throughout the piles of worthless scrap.*

2395
04:27:07,000 --> 04:27:24,000
*At first, she was unable to understand the documents that she had found. Each sheet was covered with text on one side and blank on the other; each line was completely unrelated to the next, making it impossible to glean any meaning from the whole.*

2396
04:27:24,000 --> 04:27:35,000
*The trick revealed itself, however, while she was sorting the pages that made no sense. She found that each line continued on the same line of a different page.*

2397
04:27:35,000 --> 04:27:45,000
*In Ogai's diary, for example, the first day began on the first line, then continued not with the next line, but with the first line on the next page.*

2398
04:27:45,000 --> 04:28:00,000
*Similarly, the second day was the second line, the third day was the third line, and so on and so forth. After filling all the lines on one set of pages, Ogai had torn them out and scattered them among his other files.*

2399
04:28:00,000 --> 04:28:12,000
*There was no regularity to how the pages were numbered, of course. Unable to locate any sort of key or legend, Ryoko had no choice but to figure out the page order manually.*

2400
04:28:12,000 --> 04:28:29,000
*Despite knowing that the task would be exhausting, Ryoko set to it valiantly. After separating all of the looseleaf sheets from the jumbled files, she began the painstaking process of linking pages together according to the contents of their first line.*

2401
04:28:29,000 --> 04:28:43,000
*She found that Ogai had dismantled and scattered his diary each time he completed a number of days equal to the lines on one page, and had done the same with his research notes every thirty pages or so.*

2402
04:28:43,000 --> 04:29:01,000
*The diary was much easier to restore. Because the entries varied in length, later pages had a larger number of blank lines. The page with only one line, therefore, was the last page of the diary, and those with the most blank spaces could be considered closer to the end.*

2403
04:29:01,000 --> 04:29:08,000
*Ryoko's perseverance has paid off, for she has already succeeded in restoring several volumes of Ogai's diary.*

2404
04:29:08,000 --> 04:29:14,000
*As she reads them, she feels despair draining her spirit, as it has so many times before.*

2405
04:29:14,000 --> 04:29:26,000
*This cursed feeling of powerlessness that comes with knowing hidden truths -- those who have tasted it once shall be beaten down by it again and again, until the day they die.*

2406
04:29:26,000 --> 04:29:39,000
*All secrets are connected, after all. Once you have glimpsed even the tiniest fraction of the world's true face, you have no choice but to watch in horror as the veil rolls itself back inch by inch.*

2407
04:29:39,000 --> 04:29:46,000
*All that remains is to wait for the day when insanity will crush your reason under its ever-mounting weight.*

2408
04:29:46,000 --> 04:29:59,000
*"I have succeeded in communicating with the organism. It shows enormous curiosity, and its intelligence is beyond doubt. See research notes for confirmed voice patterns and body language."*

2409
04:29:59,000 --> 04:30:10,000
*"Its appetite for knowledge is insatiable, and its learning efficiency is off the charts. However, it exhibits absolutely no desire to be recognized as an individual.*

2410
04:30:10,000 --> 04:30:16,000
*Its ego appears to be quite weak, suggesting a psyche wholly unlike that of a human."*

2411
04:30:16,000 --> 04:30:26,000
*"The speed of the organism's linguistic development is astounding. When I laughed at its mispronunciations, it immediately picked up the concept of puns.*

2412
04:30:26,000 --> 04:30:40,000
*Ever since, it has been employing its entire vocabulary in an attempt to find puns that will 'make me laugh.' Perhaps, in a few days' time, it will have learned enough language for us to communicate freely."*

2413
04:30:40,000 --> 04:30:53,000
*"The organism's command of spoken language is now sufficient to facilitate higher-level discourse, but although it has regaled me with questions all day, it remains unable to answer any of mine.*

2414
04:30:53,000 --> 04:31:02,000
*Its replies suggest that it only gained awareness after materializing in this universe. It has no knowledge of where it came from.*

2415
04:31:02,000 --> 04:31:14,000
*While I am disappointed, the fact that it has reached this level of intelligence only one week after starting to think tells me that there is no end to what I can learn from it."*

2416
04:31:14,000 --> 04:31:33,000
*"Hypothesis. It is not a naturally-occurring organism, but was created by an even more sophisticated sentient lifeform. This would explain why it has no ego yet possesses such a hunger for knowledge. It might be some sort of reconnaissance 'drone' that was sent here from another world."*

2417
04:31:33,000 --> 04:31:38,000
*Ryoko smiles humorlessly for the umpteenth time since she started reading.*

2418
04:31:38,000 --> 04:31:47,000
*How wonderful it would be if she could laugh the diary off as the delusions of a madman or the work of a science-fiction writer.*

2419
04:31:47,000 --> 04:31:49,000
*Alas, she knows far too much.*

2420
04:31:49,000 --> 04:31:57,000
*When she thinks back to the many horrors that Ogai brought into her life, the words before her take on chilling credibility.*

2421
04:31:57,000 --> 04:32:02,000
*"I have confirmed that the organism's brainpower far surpasses any human's.*

2422
04:32:02,000 --> 04:32:14,000
*This morning, I taught it about prime numbers. After I explained the Lucas-Lehmer test for Mersenne primes, it immediately began to list examples that it had calculated in its head.*

2423
04:32:14,000 --> 04:32:22,000
*I was only able to confirm by memory up to number 10, M89, but it continued to list further examples without any trouble.*

2424
04:32:22,000 --> 04:32:31,000
*I left it to its calculations, and when I returned a few hours later, I discovered that it had written down more than 70 of them.*

2425
04:32:31,000 --> 04:32:41,000
*Computers all over the world are currently working to calculate Mersenne primes, but the last one I remember being found was the 39th back in 2001."*

2426
04:32:41,000 --> 04:32:52,000
*"When I entered several of the results into my laptop and ran the Lucas-Lehmer test on them, I found that every one was correct. The same is no doubt true of the rest.*

2427
04:32:52,000 --> 04:33:03,000
*After all, the organism has never shown the pathological need for respect that would lead it to lie about its accomplishments. I see no reason to doubt its veracity.*

2428
04:33:03,000 --> 04:33:18,000
*If I could reveal to the world an expedient method for discovering Mersenne primes, the prize money would make me a billionaire. Of course, my current research is worth far more than any sum of money. I must keep it secret.*

2429
04:33:18,000 --> 04:33:30,000
*The organism's computational speed exceeds that of even the most powerful supercomputers. I can only conclude that its cognitive faculties are beyond anything humanity can imagine."*

2430
04:33:30,000 --> 04:33:34,000
*"At the organism's request, we have begun a new field of study.*

2431
04:33:34,000 --> 04:33:46,000
*Despite its immeasurable aptitude for mathematics, it now desires to concentrate on sociology and the natural sciences. Perhaps our math problems are simply too elementary for it.*

2432
04:33:46,000 --> 04:34:02,000
*It has shown especially keen interest in the means by which organisms reproduce and multiply. As it possesses nothing that could be called emotion, I hesitate to use this description, but when it learned about DNA, it seemed somehow 'excited.'"*

2433
04:34:02,000 --> 04:34:13,000
*"In fact, the organism itself seemed surprised by its reaction. When asked about the nature of the impulse, the organism decided to label it interesting development.*

2434
04:34:13,000 --> 04:34:27,000
*It would mean that there is a deeper level to its psyche than just the knowledge it has acquired since coming to this world. If I can use this discovery to trace its roots, I might be able to learn what it truly is.*

2435
04:34:27,000 --> 04:34:35,000
*Note. Candidates for the plane and world of the organism's origin are discussed in On the Silver Key, filed separately."*

2436
04:34:35,000 --> 04:34:39,000
*"I spent the whole day carrying books into its room.*

2437
04:34:39,000 --> 04:34:53,000
*Apparently, the organism is no longer satisfied by the knowledge I am able to impart. It should come as no surprise, considering its linguistic prowess, but the speed at which it consumes texts is astounding."*

2438
04:34:53,000 --> 04:34:59,000
*The diary continues for some time, chronicling the intimate relationship between Ogai and "it."*

2439
04:34:59,000 --> 04:35:11,000
*In the back of her mind, Ryoko imagines the old doctor climbing down the well in the middle of the night to hold congress with some inhuman creature in that bizarre laboratory.*

2440
04:35:11,000 --> 04:35:19,000
*The image is disturbingly similar to the nightmares that have shattered the silence of many nights with her screams.*

2441
04:35:19,000 --> 04:35:24,000
*What follows, however, makes even her worst nightmares pale in comparison.*

2442
04:35:24,000 --> 04:35:33,000
*"The organism has made a very strange request. This is the first time it has asked for anything other than food and reading materials.*

2443
04:35:33,000 --> 04:35:45,000
*I can hardly believe it, but it wants to consume the sperm of living creatures. This is separate from its desire for food. Once again, it is describing this impulse as 'instinctive.'*

2444
04:35:45,000 --> 04:35:58,000
*Now that it has declared itself a 'lifeform that requires the seed of males,' it has begun to identify itself as 'female.' After today, I suppose I shall have to start calling the organism a 'she.'"*

2445
04:35:58,000 --> 04:36:05,000
*"Is the personality that she has begun to exhibit really just an imitation created for her amusement?*

2446
04:36:05,000 --> 04:36:23,000
*Ever since she started to immerse herself in our literature, she has been acting astonishingly human. She identifies herself as female, and already possesses an enormous store of cultural knowledge. Is she trying to create a human identity for herself based on these?*

2447
04:36:23,000 --> 04:36:27,000
*I have seen her laugh, grow angry, and today... she cried.*

2448
04:36:27,000 --> 04:36:32,000
*Is she just copying our emotional displays? If not, then she is already..."*

2449
04:36:32,000 --> 04:36:37,000
*"Is the 'soul' something that any intelligent lifeform can acquire?*

2450
04:36:37,000 --> 04:36:43,000
*I feel that I am witnessing something more mysterious than the genesis of life itself."*

2451
04:36:43,000 --> 04:36:49,000
*"Today is her birthday. Although it is a year late, I want to give her a special gift.*

2452
04:36:49,000 --> 04:37:02,000
*'Saya' was the name of my mother's cat. In childhood, she was my sole friend and my beloved. I decided long ago that if I were ever blessed with children, I would give this name to my daughter.*

2453
04:37:02,000 --> 04:37:04,000
*Happy birthday, Saya.*

2454
04:37:04,000 --> 04:37:08,000
*Let this be the name of your soul. You have earned it."*

2455
04:37:08,000 --> 04:37:15,000
*"The ability that Saya has discovered in herself is showing more extraordinary results each day.*

2456
04:37:15,000 --> 04:37:23,000
*I have no doubt that she is a kind of artist. What exactly is it that she created in her body from the rat semen I gave her?*

2457
04:37:23,000 --> 04:37:32,000
*At this point, I can only surmise that it is a type of retrovirus -- a reverse transcriptase enzyme that creates exactly what she desires."*

2458
04:37:32,000 --> 04:37:37,000
*"The rats that have been transformed by her art are so very beautiful now.*

2459
04:37:37,000 --> 04:38:01,000
*The many enzymes secreted by her body and the various appendages she uses are discussed in detail in my biological observations, filed separately. Here, I will say this. By witnessing Saya perform her operations on several rats, I have gained much confidence in my theory that her body is designed specifically to manipulate the biology of other organisms."*

2460
04:38:01,000 --> 04:38:14,000
*Ryoko looks grimly at the still-unsorted mountain of research notes. When she finally manages to separate those papers, she will probably find the many other files mentioned in the diary.*

2461
04:38:14,000 --> 04:38:27,000
*Ogai's biological observations -- at the very least, she wants to look through those before facing the thing called "Saya." Under no circumstances does she want to go into battle unprepared.*

2462
04:38:27,000 --> 04:38:37,000
*She looks at her watch and sees that it's already seven in the morning. Assuming Tonoh Koji made no stops, he should be arriving in Tokyo about now.*

2463
04:38:37,000 --> 04:38:46,000
*Now that it's too late, she wishes she'd stopped that stubborn fool from leaving -- even if she'd had to shoot him in the leg to do it.*

2464
04:38:46,000 --> 04:38:52,000
*Koji pulls up two blocks away from the Sakisaka house and stares at the silent building.*

2465
04:38:52,000 --> 04:39:03,000
*In the bright light of morning, the house seems shrouded in a dark miasma, like a black hole torn out of the landscape. Is it just a figment of Koji's imagination?*

2466
04:39:03,000 --> 04:39:11,000
*Every window is closed, offering no glimpse of the inside. Koji has no way of knowing whether Fuminori is home.*

2467
04:39:11,000 --> 04:39:18,000
*A pedestrian walks his dog down the street, glancing back at Koji after he passes by the Accord.*

2468
04:39:18,000 --> 04:39:29,000
*Koji isn't surprised by the attention. He hasn't bathed or changed clothes since spending the night buried in mud, so he must look like a vagrant even inside his car.*

2469
04:39:29,000 --> 04:39:42,000
*When he looks into the rearview mirror, he sees the haggard visage of a man with one foot in the grave staring back at him. It's hard to believe that the tired, unshaven face is really his.*

2470
04:39:42,000 --> 04:39:50,000
*If he stays here for too long, someone might report him to the police. He'd better pull himself together and get moving.*

2471
04:39:50,000 --> 04:39:58,000
*He drives slowly up to the front of Fuminori's house, quickly checks to make sure no one is around, and gets out of the car.*

2472
04:39:58,000 --> 04:40:06,000
*Anyone who might be in the house probably heard the sound of the engine, but there's no point in worrying about that now.*

2473
04:40:06,000 --> 04:40:17,000
*Koji walks swiftly through the gate and yard to the front door. He puts his hand on the doorknob, forgoing the bell. The time for such pleasantries has passed.*

2474
04:40:17,000 --> 04:40:21,000
*The door is unlocked, and the knob turns easily in his hand.*

2475
04:40:21,000 --> 04:40:32,000
*He puts his ear to the door and listens for any sign of life. He's acting like a thief, he realizes with some shame, but that is the least of his worries now.*

2476
04:40:32,000 --> 04:40:41,000
*No sound from within. After checking the street again to make sure no one is looking, he quickly opens the door and disappears inside.*

2477
04:40:41,000 --> 04:40:54,000
*An indescribable stink immediately assaults his nostrils. He is already prepared for anything, however, so rather than discourage him, the stench only sharpens his caution to a razor's edge.*

2478
04:40:54,000 --> 04:41:01,000
*He has crossed this threshold many times in the past, and his memories of days spent here are still bright.*

2479
04:41:01,000 --> 04:41:08,000
*So why? Why does he feel the same ominous, blood-chilling aura that permeated Ogai's home and cabin?*

2480
04:41:08,000 --> 04:41:14,000
*Anger and sorrow seize Koji's heart, as though a dear friend's grave has been defiled.*

2481
04:41:14,000 --> 04:41:21,000
*Koji doesn't remove his shoes before entering. He knows why he's here, and it's not to be polite.*

2482
04:41:21,000 --> 04:41:31,000
*Every storm shutter is closed, filling the house with gloom, and he can see nothing but pitch black darkness through the open doors in the hallway.*

2483
04:41:31,000 --> 04:41:44,000
*He should have brought his flashlight from the car, he thinks ruefully, then remembers that he dropped the light when Fuminori attacked him. It's still lying in the backyard of the cabin in Tochigi.*

2484
04:41:44,000 --> 04:41:51,000
*The house might be empty; then again, it might not. Each particle of the air seems charged with silent menace.*

2485
04:41:51,000 --> 04:42:02,000
*Is his enemy lurking somewhere in the darkness? It's not hard to imagine Fuminori waiting for a chance to take him by surprise and finish what the well failed to.*

2486
04:42:02,000 --> 04:42:16,000
*Koji walks down the first floor hallway, then climbs the stairs and checks the second floor too. He moves slowly and carefully, keeping his senses sharp, but feels nothing watching him from the shadows.*

2487
04:42:16,000 --> 04:42:21,000
*After completing his rounds safely, he is convinced that the house is empty.*

2488
04:42:21,000 --> 04:42:31,000
*He suddenly realizes that his right hand is touching the cold steel of the gun in his pocket. Did he intend to draw the weapon upon encountering Fuminori?*

2489
04:42:31,000 --> 04:42:36,000
*Now that Koji thinks about it, his own actions seem mysterious to him.*

2490
04:42:36,000 --> 04:42:46,000
*What is he planning to do when he meets Fuminori? Will he lay into him with curses and epithets? Will he force him to turn himself in? Or will he...*

2491
04:42:46,000 --> 04:42:51,000
*Koji shakes his head. This isn't the time for such hopeless questions.*

2492
04:42:51,000 --> 04:42:57,000
*If he keeps thinking, he'll stop moving; if he stops moving, fear will paralyze him forever.*

2493
04:42:57,000 --> 04:43:03,000
*His only choice is to keep marching on. He has to close the distance to his prey.*

2494
04:43:03,000 --> 04:43:15,000
*In any case, Fuminori isn't home. What form their reunion takes will probably be decided at the moment of their meeting. All Koji has to do is not hesitate when the time comes.*

2495
04:43:15,000 --> 04:43:19,000
*Still, why does the whole house smell like stagnant water?*

2496
04:43:19,000 --> 04:43:28,000
*It's been three months since Fuminori distanced himself from his friends. Just what kind of life has he been leading all this time?*

2497
04:43:28,000 --> 04:43:38,000
*Koji enters the living room and feels along the wall for the light switch. The moment he flips it on, the answer to his question is revealed.*

2498
04:43:38,000 --> 04:43:39,000
Koji: "Wha..."

2499
04:43:39,000 --> 04:43:47,000
*How far has Fuminori gone? Koji realizes that this is the first time he has encountered Fuminori's insanity in visible form.*

2500
04:43:47,000 --> 04:43:59,000
*From the dust piled in the corners of the room, it is clear that the paint was not applied recently. How many nights has Fuminori spent surrounded by this maddening array of color?*

2501
04:43:59,000 --> 04:44:07,000
*Why, if such obvious signs were available -- why didn't Koji realize that something was wrong before it got this bad?*

2502
04:44:07,000 --> 04:44:14,000
*Was he deaf to the dying screams of Fuminori's sanity? Was their friendship really so worthless?*

2503
04:44:14,000 --> 04:44:28,000
*As he stands petrified in the unfamiliar living room, Koji directs his anger entirely at himself. If he could, he would like nothing more than to apologize to Fuminori for failing to help him through his suffering.*

2504
04:44:28,000 --> 04:44:38,000
*Koji feels that he might have been able to save his friend. Perhaps he is arrogant to think so -- but if so, it is arrogance born of kindness.*

2505
04:44:38,000 --> 04:44:44,000
*Koji passes through the living room and opens the sliding door that leads to the kitchen.*

2506
04:44:44,000 --> 04:44:51,000
*When he enters, he finds that the most disturbing of the house's many stenches is strongest here.*

2507
04:44:51,000 --> 04:44:57,000
*Blood. The room is redolent with the smell of countless layers of blood grown stale over time.*

2508
04:44:57,000 --> 04:44:59,000
*He peers into the well-used sink.*

2509
04:44:59,000 --> 04:45:05,000
*Around the rim, he sees faint, brownish-red blotches that water alone couldn't rinse off.*

2510
04:45:05,000 --> 04:45:19,000
*Even more obvious are the stains on the dishrag. Such stains are proof that the rag has been used and reused countless times -- but what could it have been used on to make it that sickening burgundy color?*

2511
04:45:19,000 --> 04:45:26,000
*Koji stares at the refrigerator next to the counter as though it were a monster waiting to swallow him whole.*

2512
04:45:26,000 --> 04:45:31,000
*He stands motionless until he is able to work up the courage simply to touch it.*

2513
04:45:31,000 --> 04:45:39,000
*Then he steels himself, grabs the thick handle, and opens the door. First he'll check the freezer, then the refrigerator.*

2514
04:45:39,000 --> 04:45:50,000
*The freezer is packed with frozen meat of varying shapes and sizes. As each piece is wrapped tightly in frosted-over plastic, he can't tell what kind of meat it is.*

2515
04:45:50,000 --> 04:45:55,000
*The meat in the refrigerator, however, has already been thawed for consumption.*

2516
04:45:55,000 --> 04:46:03,000
*For a while, he can only stare in disbelief at the five fingers beckoning to him from the back of the compartment.*

2517
04:46:03,000 --> 04:46:10,000
*They are the long, slender fingers of a woman, their bluish tinge giving them the appearance of waxworks.*

2518
04:46:10,000 --> 04:46:18,000
*Koji is unable to remember what Omi's hands looked like, even though he has kissed her fingers countless times.*

2519
04:46:18,000 --> 04:46:27,000
*When he finished crying after his conversation with Fuminori, Koji promised himself that he would not cry again -- and in fact, he does not.*

2520
04:46:27,000 --> 04:46:31,000
*He regrets his decision, however. He indulged himself too early.*

2521
04:46:31,000 --> 04:46:42,000
*He should have saved his soothing tears for this moment, for now he knows that truly, nothing is sacred. At last, his doubts about Fuminori have been utterly obliterated.*

2522
04:46:42,000 --> 04:46:49,000
*Koji pulls Ogai's revolver out of his pocket and wraps his hands around its grip like he would a charm.*

2523
04:46:49,000 --> 04:46:56,000
*Its definite presence -- its promise of merciful annihilation -- is the only thing keeping his sanity intact.*

2524
04:46:56,000 --> 04:46:59,000
*He will surely use it to kill Sakisaka Fuminori.*

2525
04:46:59,000 --> 04:47:00,000
*Not for revenge.*

2526
04:47:00,000 --> 04:47:01,000
*Not for justice.*

2527
04:47:01,000 --> 04:47:09,000
*But to make this world once more a place governed by reason. For that purpose alone, he must eliminate the anomaly.*

2528
04:47:09,000 --> 04:47:16,000
*He breathes deep, exhales, then lifts his hand before his face and stares at his spread fingers.*

2529
04:47:16,000 --> 04:47:21,000
*Alright, he's not shaking. He is prepared to face his new objective.*

2530
04:47:21,000 --> 04:47:26,000
*Koji sticks the revolver back into his pocket and pulls out his phone.*

2531
04:47:26,000 --> 04:47:28,000
*It's time to finish this.*

2532
04:47:28,000 --> 04:47:32,000
*Just as he promised earlier, Koji calls Fuminori again.*

2533
04:47:32,000 --> 04:47:37,000
*The call goes through immediately. He must have been waiting for it.*

2534
04:47:37,000 --> 04:47:39,000
Fuminori: "Hey Koji. Where are you?"

2535
04:47:39,000 --> 04:47:41,000
Koji: "What difference does it make?"

2536
04:47:41,000 --> 04:47:49,000
*As soon as Koji responds, a shrill ringing fills the house. Startled, Koji spins around and looks into the hallway.*

2537
04:47:49,000 --> 04:47:53,000
*The house phone is flashing to signal an incoming call.*

2538
04:47:53,000 --> 04:47:57,000
Fuminori: "Hmm, I see. I figured you'd be at my house."

2539
04:47:57,000 --> 04:48:11,000
*Koji fell for it. Fuminori is the one calling the house, and now he knows exactly where Koji is. He must have predicted that this would be Koji's first stop, and that Koji would call him upon finding it empty.*

2540
04:48:11,000 --> 04:48:15,000
Fuminori: "So, I guess you've already seen everything."

2541
04:48:15,000 --> 04:48:29,000
Koji: "Yeah." Koji keeps his voice bold to conceal his horror. When did Fuminori become so cunning? "It looks like you've become quite the meat-eater since we last met. Just how many people have you killed?"

2542
04:48:29,000 --> 04:48:44,000
Fuminori: "Actually, I've only killed one so far," Fuminori replies unapologetically, his tone upbeat. "I've taken apart three or four, though. I'm getting pretty good at removing the tendons and draining the blood and such."

2543
04:48:44,000 --> 04:48:56,000
*Koji no longer feels sadness or horror when faced with Fuminori's inhumanity. There is only the cold desire to kill the creature speaking such revolting words with his friend's voice.*

2544
04:48:56,000 --> 04:49:03,000
Koji: "You killed Omi, didn't you? You bastard. You were lying when you said you hadn't seen her."

2545
04:49:03,000 --> 04:49:08,000
Fuminori: "Hmm, I wonder..." Fuminori mutters, seeming somehow embarassed.

2546
04:49:08,000 --> 04:49:15,000
Fuminori:  she disappeared, come to think of it. The body wasn't in any shape that I could identify."

2547
04:49:15,000 --> 04:49:21,000
*Koji had already abandoned hope, but it's still a shock to hear of his lover's brutal end.*

2548
04:49:21,000 --> 04:49:22,000
Koji: "Tsukuba too?"

2549
04:49:22,000 --> 04:49:33,000
Fuminori: "No," Fuminori says with an exasperated chuckle. "She's here, like I promised. I'm no fool. I need her to trade with you, right? I won't waste her."

2550
04:49:33,000 --> 04:49:35,000
Koji: "Let me hear her voice."

2551
04:49:35,000 --> 04:49:40,000
Fuminori: "I don't think that's possible. She's in no shape to talk."

2552
04:49:40,000 --> 04:49:44,000
*Fuminori's dismissive words further sharpen Koji's bloodlust.*

2553
04:49:44,000 --> 04:49:48,000
Koji: "You forget what I said? If you don't let her go unharmed..."

2554
04:49:48,000 --> 04:49:54,000
Fuminori: "Come on, be happy that she's still alive. Or would you rather have Yoh as a corpse?"

2555
04:49:54,000 --> 04:49:55,000
Koji: "......"

2556
04:49:55,000 --> 04:50:07,000
Fuminori: "Let's get this straight, Koji. You bring your evidence along with all the files you've gathered. When I'm satisfied that they're the real thing, I'll hand Yoh over."

2557
04:50:07,000 --> 04:50:08,000
Koji: "Fine."

2558
04:50:08,000 --> 04:50:25,000
*It's obvious that this deal is a sham. In all likelihood, Fuminori is planning to kill him and bury his secrets forever. Moreover, Koji doubts that Yoh is even alive. Her meat could very well be somewhere in the refrigerator right in front of him.*

2559
04:50:25,000 --> 04:50:40,000
*However, Koji isn't particularly interested in Fuminori's true intentions; after all, he has no intention of making a trade either. His only goal is to get close enough to destroy Fuminori and whatever is pulling his strings.*

2560
04:50:40,000 --> 04:50:41,000
Koji: "Where?"

2561
04:50:41,000 --> 04:50:49,000
Fuminori: "You remember Dr. Ogai's house? The one you followed me to. Let's meet there tonight at seven. Come alone."

2562
04:50:49,000 --> 04:50:50,000
Koji: "Hey!"

2563
04:50:50,000 --> 04:50:54,000
*Fuminori hangs up without waiting for Koji's response.*

2564
04:50:54,000 --> 04:51:04,000
*Perhaps Fuminori, too, has sensed his opponent's intent. If so, then he has realized that Koji is not just the hunted, but the hunter as well.*

2565
04:51:04,000 --> 04:51:08,000
*((So, we're two duelists trying to gauge each other's moves.))*

2566
04:51:08,000 --> 04:51:15,000
*Koji smiles grimly as he pockets his phone. It's astounding how much their relationship has changed.*

2567
04:51:15,000 --> 04:51:36,000
*The question is whether or not to comply with the seven o'clock rendezvous agreement. If this were a serious negotiation, then it would be wise to avoid preempting Fuminori in any way that could provoke his anger. What Koji and Fuminori are really doing, however, is trying to lure each other into a deadly trap.*

2568
04:51:36,000 --> 04:51:44,000
*Koji doesn't know what Fuminori plans to do between now and then, but he's not about to let his enemy keep the initiative.*

2569
04:51:44,000 --> 04:51:51,000
*The fierce bloodlust that has taken root in his heart is more than enough to energize his exhausted body.*

2570
04:51:51,000 --> 04:51:56,000
*Koji leaves the death-filled house, his stride more determined than before.*

2571
04:51:56,000 --> 04:52:06,000
*The ringing of her cell phone interrupts Ryoko's labors. When she sees that the caller is Tonoh Koji, she unwittingly breathes a sigh of relief.*

2572
04:52:06,000 --> 04:52:08,000
Ryoko: "This is Tanbo. What is it?"

2573
04:52:08,000 --> 04:52:11,000
Koji: "I've searched Fuminori's house."

2574
04:52:11,000 --> 04:52:21,000
*Even over the phone, Ryoko can hear the change in Koji's tone. His is the dull, flat voice of someone who has had all the energy beaten out of him.*

2575
04:52:21,000 --> 04:52:28,000
Koji: "Fuminori has... murdered people. He's killed too many people to count, and he's... eating them."

2576
04:52:28,000 --> 04:52:29,000
Ryoko: "......"

2577
04:52:29,000 --> 04:52:42,000
*His first steps into Ryoko's world have already brought him face-to-face with something particularly gruesome. In consideration of his probable state of mind, she decides to say nothing.*

2578
04:52:42,000 --> 04:52:48,000
Koji: "Omi is dead," Koji continues. "Tsukuba too, probably. Doctor... I was wrong."

2579
04:52:48,000 --> 04:53:16,000
Ryoko: "The fact that you're still alive to make this call means you haven't made a fatal mistake yet," Ryoko says, praising Koji in her own way. Whether he is comforted or not is up to him. "Anyway, don't screw up this time. Do nothing until I return. What we're dealing with here... isn't going down easy." With her understanding of Saya deepening by the hour, Ryoko is able to make this declaration with new confidence.

2580
04:53:16,000 --> 04:53:23,000
Koji: "Fuminori already knows I'm alive. I didn't tell him who rescued me, but he's definitely on guard."

2581
04:53:23,000 --> 04:53:24,000
Ryoko: "I see."

2582
04:53:24,000 --> 04:53:34,000
*Koji's actions were rash, but there's no point regretting them now. The constructive approach would be to use the pressure that he's placed on Fuminori.*

2583
04:53:34,000 --> 04:53:43,000
*Ryoko's involvement is still a secret. That makes her a wild card. Depending on how she plays it, this advantage could be decisive.*

2584
04:53:43,000 --> 04:53:45,000
Koji: "Have you found anything?"

2585
04:53:45,000 --> 04:54:01,000
Ryoko: "Not enough yet," Ryoko answers, glancing sidelong at the looseleaf pages still scattered across the table. "Let's see... I'll wrap this up by evening and return to Tokyo around midnight. You stay out of trouble until then. Got it?"

2586
04:54:01,000 --> 04:54:02,000
Koji: "Yes."

2587
04:54:02,000 --> 04:54:12,000
*The lack of emotion in Koji's voice is actually reassuring to Ryoko. He's a machine now, able to do whatever it takes to accomplish a single goal*

2588
04:54:12,000 --> 04:54:20,000
*He is even willing to accept help from Ryoko, whose principles hardly mesh with his. A praiseworthy change, indeed.*

2589
04:54:20,000 --> 04:54:27,000
*After Ryoko hangs up, she gloomily counts the stacks of looseleaf that still need to be restored.*

2590
04:54:27,000 --> 04:54:32,000
*There's no time left. She'll probably only be able to get the general picture.*

2591
04:54:32,000 --> 04:54:48,000
*If she has to go into battle with only fragmentary knowledge, then there's one thing that she absolutely must decipher -- Ogai's biological reports, which should contain information on the strengths and weaknesses of the organism called "Saya."*

2592
04:54:48,000 --> 04:54:54,000
*All she can do now is pray for luck as she dives back into the mountains of paper.*

2593
04:54:54,000 --> 04:55:11,000
*Today was the first time I've driven since my accident last summer. The proposition was always too dangerous to consider, given my inability to recognize roads and cars. Things have changed, however, in the three months I've had to adapt to my condition.*

2594
04:55:11,000 --> 04:55:30,000
*I know what cars and pedestrians look like now, and even though I can't exactly see colors, I've learned to decipher lights and turn signals. I still can't read street signs, of course. Nevertheless, I managed to make it safely to our destination with Saya and Yoh in the back seat.*

2595
04:55:30,000 --> 04:55:39,000
*It was Saya who came up with the idea for our new hideout -- an abandoned building she'd discovered while living with Dr. Ogai.*

2596
04:55:39,000 --> 04:55:50,000
*In these hilly suburban residential areas, it's not hard to find thick patches of undeveloped forest just off the beaten path. Saya's old flow of everyday life.*

2597
04:55:50,000 --> 04:56:01,000
*It used to be a privately operated sanatorium hidden among the silent trees. After the owners went bankrupt, it remained unsold and was eventually forgotten.*

2598
04:56:01,000 --> 04:56:10,000
*After I left Saya and Yoh at the hideout, I returned to town to make some preparations. Now I'm finally back at our new refuge.*

2599
04:56:10,000 --> 04:56:25,000
*I liked this ruin from the moment I saw it. Mountains of construction materials and garbage litter the front yard, forming a serviceable barricade. This place looks even less likely to receive unwanted attention than our house.*

2600
04:56:25,000 --> 04:56:38,000
*Since my brain sees humans as revolting monsters, places they've been tend to stink or seem covered in filthy slime. Ruins like these, long empty of life, are the places I find the most restful.*

2601
04:56:38,000 --> 04:56:46,000
Fuminori: "I'm back," I call out to let them know I'm not a stranger. Then I go down to the basement where they're hiding.

2602
04:56:46,000 --> 04:56:49,000
Saya: "Welcome back. Were you okay with the car?"

2603
04:56:49,000 --> 04:57:01,000
Fuminori: "It was no problem at all. I've figured out how to tell which roads are one way. As long as I keep my speed down, there's nothing to worry about. So, how are things here?"

2604
04:57:01,000 --> 04:57:09,000
Saya: "I took a look around. As I thought, there's no sign that anyone's been here since I found this place. It's safe."

2605
04:57:09,000 --> 04:57:12,000
Fuminori: "I see. Let's hope it stays that way."

2606
04:57:12,000 --> 04:57:19,000
*I'm a little worried that this abandoned building could become a hangout for biker gangs or homeless people.*

2607
04:57:19,000 --> 04:57:27,000
Saya: "It's probably because of all the trash piled out front. Most people won't get anywhere near that, don't you think?"

2608
04:57:27,000 --> 04:57:28,000
Fuminori: "I guess."

2609
04:57:28,000 --> 04:57:35,000
*It doesn't bother me at all. I rather like it, in fact. But of course, normal people would feel differently.*

2610
04:57:35,000 --> 04:57:39,000
Saya: "So, how was your shopping? Did you find something good?"

2611
04:57:39,000 --> 04:57:41,000
Fuminori: "I sure did."

2612
04:57:41,000 --> 04:57:50,000
*I proudly unwrap the weapon I just bought from a camping goods store -- a one-meter-long wood axe, the biggest and sturdiest I could find.*

2613
04:57:50,000 --> 04:58:00,000
Fuminori: "I like how this was right next to a sign saying that long knives are illegal. Seems like you could do way more damage with one of these."

2614
04:58:00,000 --> 04:58:18,000
*I grip the axe with both hands, testing its dependable weight, then swing it like a baseball bat. The deadly steel blade sweeps through the air right where a person's neck would be. Yoh, who's sprawled out on the floor, flinches at the sound and curls herself into a ball.*

2615
04:58:18,000 --> 04:58:21,000
Saya: "How sharp is it? Want to test it on Yoh?"

2616
04:58:21,000 --> 04:58:24,000
Fuminori: "Um... I don't think that's a good idea."

2617
04:58:24,000 --> 04:58:28,000
*I definitely wasn't expecting Saya to suggest anything so brutal.*

2618
04:58:28,000 --> 04:58:34,000
Saya: "You don't need to worry. Yoh's new body can heal pretty easily from cuts and such."

2619
04:58:34,000 --> 04:58:36,000
Fuminori: "But I'm sure it'll hurt."

2620
04:58:36,000 --> 04:58:50,000
Saya: "Oh. Yeah, I guess you're right." It must have slipped her mind completely. She smiles at the oblivious Yoh as if to hide her embarrassment, then says, "But her screams are pretty adorable, don't you think?"

2621
04:58:50,000 --> 04:58:55,000
Fuminori: "Well... I just wouldn't feel right using an axe on a human."

2622
04:58:55,000 --> 04:58:57,000
Saya: "Really? Then what about Koji?"

2623
04:58:57,000 --> 04:58:59,000
Fuminori: "That's easy."

2624
04:58:59,000 --> 04:59:04,000
*It should be obvious, but I guess that Saya still doesn't understand.*

2625
04:59:04,000 --> 04:59:09,000
Fuminori: "I don't see him as human. I'll have no trouble cutting him to pieces."

2626
04:59:09,000 --> 04:59:12,000
Saya: "That really makes a difference?"

2627
04:59:12,000 --> 04:59:23,000
Fuminori: "Yeah. Humans have a conscience, you see. No matter how much you hate someone, you can't help but think twice about killing them. And that's how I'll win."

2628
04:59:23,000 --> 04:59:24,000
Saya: "......Really?"

2629
04:59:24,000 --> 04:59:31,000
*Saya seems awfully subdued. I guess she's concerned about what'll happen when I have it out with Koji.*

2630
04:59:31,000 --> 04:59:41,000
Fuminori: "He's bigger and stronger, so I might not have much chance against him in a straight-up fight. But what's just 'slaying a monster' to me is

2631
04:59:41,000 --> 04:59:52,000
Saya: "I'm a little worried," Saya says softly, staring at the floor with unusual gravity. "You can never be sure how someone will react. It's dangerous to rely on that."

2632
04:59:52,000 --> 04:59:55,000
*She raises her head and looks straight at me.*

2633
04:59:55,000 --> 04:59:59,000
Saya: "Don't you think it'd be better if I hunt him?"

2634
04:59:59,000 --> 05:00:08,000
*I appreciate Saya's consideration. Even though it could be interpreted as a lack of faith in me, she's still putting my safety above hers.*

2635
05:00:08,000 --> 05:00:12,000
*Nevertheless, I can't accept her heartfelt suggestion.*

2636
05:00:12,000 --> 05:00:21,000
Fuminori: "With your strength, you might be able to overpower a girl like Yoh, but I think it'd be hard for you to take down a guy."

2637
05:00:21,000 --> 05:00:34,000
*The bitter memory of Saya's rape is still fresh in my mind. Saya falls silent for a moment, seeming to understand what I'm thinking, but then comes right back to stubbornly press her case.*

2638
05:00:34,000 --> 05:00:45,000
Saya: "My first attack went fine, though. Most humans go limp as soon as they see me. It was the same in the hospital. You were the only one who could talk to me."

2639
05:00:45,000 --> 05:00:48,000
Fuminori: "Hmm... I guess you have a point."

2640
05:00:48,000 --> 05:00:57,000
*I can't imagine it personally, but I suppose it's possible that Saya's appearance is shocking enough to make someone lose their nerve.*

2641
05:00:57,000 --> 05:01:05,000
*Suzumi was able to gain the advantage because he had the same condition as me, which let him see Saya as a cute girl.*

2642
05:01:05,000 --> 05:01:16,000
*Fear doesn't necessarily make people weaker, however. Depending on the situation, it can even send someone into a berserk rage and make them harder to put down.*

2643
05:01:16,000 --> 05:01:22,000
*In other words, such a tactic would be the same sort of gamble that Saya's worried about.*

2644
05:01:22,000 --> 05:01:25,000
Fuminori: "Alright, Saya, how about this?"

2645
05:01:25,000 --> 05:01:32,000
*When I tell Saya the new plan that just popped into my head, her gloomy frown turns into a bright smile.*

2646
05:01:32,000 --> 05:01:35,000
Saya: "That's perfect! You're so smart, Fuminori!"

2647
05:01:35,000 --> 05:01:36,000
Fuminori: "Oh, stop."

2648
05:01:36,000 --> 05:01:48,000
*It's not exactly a great plan, but I guess the fact that it lessens the risk to me is enough to excite her. She's so easy to please -- but that's part of what makes her so cute.*

2649
05:01:48,000 --> 05:01:50,000
Saya: "So when's Koji coming?"

2650
05:01:50,000 --> 05:01:59,000
Fuminori: "I got a call from him this morning. For now, I've sent him on a wild goose chase. I'm thinking I should shake him up a little."

2651
05:01:59,000 --> 05:02:04,000
Saya: "It'd be best to take care of him after it's dark, don't you think?"

2652
05:02:04,000 --> 05:02:12,000
Fuminori: "Yeah. When the time is right, I'll lure him here and finish him. We won't have to worry about witnesses here."

2653
05:02:12,000 --> 05:02:14,000
Saya: "So when's Koji coming?"

2654
05:02:14,000 --> 05:02:20,000
Fuminori: "I don't know. He'll call sooner or later, and then I'll lure him here and finish him."

2655
05:02:20,000 --> 05:02:24,000
*Koji will come. I know that he won't leave us alone.*

2656
05:02:24,000 --> 05:02:31,000
*We could just keep running, now that we've started, but I want to eliminate Koji as soon as possible.*

2657
05:02:31,000 --> 05:02:37,000
*Therefore, when he contacts me, I intend to meet with him unless it's an obvious trap.*

2658
05:02:37,000 --> 05:02:44,000
Saya: "We're finally going to get more human meat. Too bad it's just going to rot without a refrigerator."

2659
05:02:44,000 --> 05:02:50,000
Fuminori: "Why don't we use it to trap other animals? It could be bait for stray cats or crows."

2660
05:02:50,000 --> 05:02:58,000
Saya: "That's too dangerous. If an animal gets away with the meat, someone might find it and wonder where it came from."

2661
05:02:58,000 --> 05:03:00,000
Fuminori: "Good point."

2662
05:03:00,000 --> 05:03:15,000
*Humans are extremely dangerous, and their filthy, stinking bodies make me sick just by being nearby. Ironically, however, nothing tastes better than their meat. I truly regret having to abandon our well-stocked fridge.*

2663
05:03:15,000 --> 05:03:22,000
Saya: "The forest around here is full of animals. I don't think we'll have any trouble finding food."

2664
05:03:22,000 --> 05:03:26,000
Fuminori: "We have three mouths to feed. Are you sure?"

2665
05:03:26,000 --> 05:03:33,000
Saya: "Leave it to me! I may not look it, but I'm a pretty good hunter. I'll be sure to keep us well fed."

2666
05:03:33,000 --> 05:03:38,000
Fuminori: "Okay. Looks like you're going to be the breadwinner of this family."

2667
05:03:38,000 --> 05:03:44,000
Saya: "Saya giggles happily at my praise. I find these childish qualities of hers adorable.

2668
05:03:44,000 --> 05:03:48,000
Saya: "I wonder how long we'll be able to relax this time."

2669
05:03:48,000 --> 05:03:54,000
*Because of the casual way she says it, I almost miss the emptiness to which her question leads.*

2670
05:03:54,000 --> 05:03:55,000
Fuminori: "Yeah..."

2671
05:03:55,000 --> 05:03:58,000
*Saya's right. This won't last forever.*

2672
05:03:58,000 --> 05:04:11,000
*No matter how safe this hideout might seem, we will have to abandon it eventually. The slightest mistake could put our life together in jeopardy -- just like when I failed to silence Koji.*

2673
05:04:11,000 --> 05:04:20,000
*Some dumb kids might decide that this old ruin is a good place to test their courage, or this land might be targeted for new development.*

2674
05:04:20,000 --> 05:04:33,000
*In order to be together with Saya, I have chosen to live apart from society. We will never find lasting peace in this world teeming with humans -- not unless we can somehow escape from it.*

2675
05:04:33,000 --> 05:04:37,000
Fuminori: "Think of like going on a journey, just the two of us."

2676
05:04:37,000 --> 05:04:53,000
*I pull Saya into my arms and fold my hands around her slender shoulders, then whisper, "Life is like a journey anyway. Nothing stays the same forever. The only difference is whether time passes you by or sweeps you up in its flow."*

2677
05:04:53,000 --> 05:04:55,000
Saya: "I guess you're right."

2678
05:04:55,000 --> 05:05:04,000
*Saya smiles softly, perhaps in resignation, perhaps in sadness -- either way, there is peace and contentment in her expression.*

2679
05:05:04,000 --> 05:05:10,000
Saya: "But we'll be together, so I'm not lonely. You're not lonely either, are you?"

2680
05:05:10,000 --> 05:05:11,000
Fuminori: "No."

2681
05:05:11,000 --> 05:05:12,000
*I have no regrets.*

2682
05:05:12,000 --> 05:05:17,000
*As long as I can hold Saya in my arms, I will gladly pay any price.*

2683
05:05:17,000 --> 05:05:26,000
Saya: "And besides," she adds brightly, trying to cheer me up. "One day, we won't have to hide anymore. I can promise you that."

2684
05:05:26,000 --> 05:05:31,000
*It sounds like a fairytale, but for some reason, she seems absolutely certain.*

2685
05:05:31,000 --> 05:05:42,000
Saya: "That day might be tomorrow, or it might be far off in the future. It's my first time, so even I don't know when the sign will come. I'm a little scared."

2686
05:05:42,000 --> 05:05:54,000
*I have no idea what Saya's prophetic words mean, but this isn't the first time that she's said or done something mysterious. She's performed any number of miracles already.*

2687
05:05:54,000 --> 05:05:57,000
Fuminori: "So there's hope for us too?"

2688
05:05:57,000 --> 05:06:00,000
Saya: "Yeah," she says with a cheerful nod.

2689
05:06:00,000 --> 05:06:05,000
Saya: "It will be my last present to you, Fuminori. My first and final duty."

2690
05:06:05,000 --> 05:06:07,000
*Koji has nothing to do but wait.*

2691
05:06:07,000 --> 05:06:29,000
*He has spent almost half a day in the dark, empty study, breathing stale air choked with mold as he strains his ears for the slightest hint of movement below. Few people could endure such a vigil, but Koji has accomplished it without complaint. If anything, the suffering is welcome, for it keeps his nerves honed to a razor's edge.*

2692
05:06:29,000 --> 05:06:51,000
*Without a doubt, his single-minded focus is the only thing allowing him to push the limits of his stamina. Koji understands this, and embraces the pain. His closest friend has shattered his world like glass, and now Koji feels only hate towards the madness that has replaced it, and towards himself for allowing it to happen.*

2693
05:06:51,000 --> 05:06:58,000
*Self-loathing is a more reliable source of willpower than any faith or resolve, no matter how noble.*

2694
05:06:58,000 --> 05:07:05,000
*When he arrived at the Ogai house, Koji snuck inside carefully, hoping to perhaps take his enemy by surprise.*

2695
05:07:05,000 --> 05:07:17,000
*It was only after he got inside that he realized the house was still abandoned. Even so, Koji was sure that Fuminori would arrive earlier than promised in order to set up an ambush.*

2696
05:07:17,000 --> 05:07:29,000
*However, the light streaming through the windows turned red, then faded to darkness with no sign of anyone coming. Koji's patience has grown weaker and weaker by the moment.*

2697
05:07:29,000 --> 05:07:32,000
*And now the appointed time has arrived.*

2698
05:07:32,000 --> 05:07:38,000
*Just as Koji's frustration is about to peak, his phone begins to vibrate and flash.*

2699
05:07:38,000 --> 05:07:42,000
*It's from Fuminori. He's calling rather than show up himself.*

2700
05:07:42,000 --> 05:07:49,000
*Rage threatens to overwhelm him for an instant, but Koji manages to keep his voice calm as he answers.*

2701
05:07:49,000 --> 05:07:52,000
Koji: "What's going on here, Fuminori?"

2702
05:07:52,000 --> 05:08:10,000
Fuminori: "Well, I was worried that you might be wasting energy on something silly, like planning an ambush," Fuminori says, chuckling scornfully. "It's kind of late, but I guess I should tell you the real meeting place before you lose your mind. Did I make it in time?"

2703
05:08:10,000 --> 05:08:12,000
Koji: "Son of a bitch..."

2704
05:08:12,000 --> 05:08:16,000
Fuminori: "Come on, don't get mad. I'm just being careful, right?"

2705
05:08:16,000 --> 05:08:23,000
*Fuminori laughs with unrestrained malevolence, as though to emphasize that he's seen through Koji's plans.*

2706
05:08:23,000 --> 05:08:36,000
Fuminori: "Assuming you're at Dr. Ogai's house, there's a place nearby, within walking distance. Yoh and I are there. I'll give you the address. You should be able to find it on your car's GPS."

2707
05:08:36,000 --> 05:08:39,000
Koji: "You have proof this isn't another trick?"

2708
05:08:39,000 --> 05:08:45,000
Fuminori: "If you're that paranoid, you don't have to come. Just turn tail and run."

2709
05:08:45,000 --> 05:08:49,000
*Fuminori hangs up immediately after speaking his challenge.*

2710
05:08:49,000 --> 05:08:56,000
*Koji leaps out of his chair and kicks it across the room, unable to find any other outlet for his rage.*

2711
05:08:56,000 --> 05:09:12,000
*He has no choice but to do what Fuminori says. His stamina is already exhausted. Only his obsession is keeping him going. If he allows himself even a moment's rest, he fears that he'll never again find the strength to face this madness.*

2712
05:09:12,000 --> 05:09:15,000
*Tonight is his only chance to kill Fuminori.*

2713
05:09:15,000 --> 05:09:24,000
*Koji knows, of course, that his enemy is planning to ambush him. Fuminori isn't going to fight fair -- but then, neither is Koji.*

2714
05:09:24,000 --> 05:09:31,000
*With the unsteady stride of a man half asleep, Koji leaves the Ogai house and heads for his Accord.*

2715
05:09:31,000 --> 05:09:43,000
*Only the base of these foothills has been developed for housing. The address Fuminori gave Koji is outside of that area, in the thick forest that still covers the mountain's face.*

2716
05:09:43,000 --> 05:09:51,000
*His car's GPS shows a road that leads nowhere, but according to Fuminori, there should be an old, abandoned sanatorium there.*

2717
05:09:51,000 --> 05:09:59,000
*It's definitely a place that no one could find, not even by accident. Maybe this next stop really will be the last.*

2718
05:09:59,000 --> 05:10:12,000
*Koji drives up the steep incline, soon leaving the residential neighborhood behind. Even though the hands of progress are right at its doorstep, the undeveloped forest is darker than he expected.*

2719
05:10:12,000 --> 05:10:18,000
*This looks like a great place to live in secret -- or to kill someone and hide the body.*

2720
05:10:18,000 --> 05:10:29,000
*Places like this, lost and forgotten, aren't found only in deep jungles and hidden valleys. Holes in the world are everywhere, even in the midst of civilization.*

2721
05:10:29,000 --> 05:10:36,000
*The hands of his watch move with agonizing slowness, as though counting down to the end of the world.*

2722
05:10:36,000 --> 05:10:45,000
*In the hours since contacting Ryoko, Koji went back to his apartment, showered, changed clothes, and even had his first full meal in days.*

2723
05:10:45,000 --> 05:10:57,000
*He wanted to take a nap, knowing that he needed the rest, but no matter how hard he tried, sleep never came. Forcing himself to relax only made his nerves colder and sharper.*

2724
05:10:57,000 --> 05:11:02,000
*With nothing else to do, he decides to wander the city until nightfall.*

2725
05:11:02,000 --> 05:11:16,000
*Downtown Tokyo is bustling. Surrounded by smiling pedestrians, bright lights, and windows decorated early for Christmas, he feels as if all of the happiness in the world has gathered in this very place.*

2726
05:11:16,000 --> 05:11:22,000
*Koji takes it all in, burning it into his memory like it's the last thing he'll ever see.*

2727
05:11:22,000 --> 05:11:33,000
*Is the world so beautiful because of the horrors that lurk in its shadows? The glow of the city can no longer warm him. Perhaps that is why it seems so precious.*

2728
05:11:33,000 --> 05:11:41,000
*Koji watches the city for hours. It feels unreachably distant, like reading the obituary of someone you loved long ago.*

2729
05:11:41,000 --> 05:11:44,000
*His phone rings at eight p.m. It's Ryoko.*

2730
05:11:44,000 --> 05:11:49,000
*Their conversation is short. She hangs up as soon as they decide where to meet.*

2731
05:11:49,000 --> 05:11:52,000
*And so ends Tonoh Koji's final night of peace.*

2732
05:11:52,000 --> 05:11:57,000
*Ryoko arrives at the diner at one a.m., one hour later than agreed upon.*

2733
05:11:57,000 --> 05:12:04,000
*She has a heavy-looking duffle bag under her arm. Koji doesn't feel like asking what the bulges represent.*

2734
05:12:04,000 --> 05:12:07,000
Ryoko: "Sorry. I had a lot to get together."

2735
05:12:07,000 --> 05:12:13,000
*Ryoko doesn't sound at all apologetic, but Koji decides to just nod expressionlessly.*

2736
05:12:13,000 --> 05:12:29,000
*Only a few tables are filled at this hour, like lonely islands in the midst of the vast restaurant. After sending the bleary-eyed waitress away with an order for two coffees, Koji and Ryoko are left all alone in a corner of the dining area.*

2737
05:12:29,000 --> 05:12:38,000
Koji: "So did you find what you were looking for?" Koji asks bluntly while sipping dutifully from his third cup of watery, tasteless coffee.

2738
05:12:38,000 --> 05:12:45,000
Ryoko: "I'd like to think I didn't make you wait for nothing, at least. Though I'm still not sure of anything."

2739
05:12:45,000 --> 05:12:52,000
Koji: "I think Fuminori is under a lot of stress. I've left him hanging for a day since I told him I'd call."

2740
05:12:52,000 --> 05:12:55,000
Ryoko: "Do you really think you have him on edge?"

2741
05:12:55,000 --> 05:12:59,000
Koji: "His reaction to the name 'Saya' was very clear."

2742
05:12:59,000 --> 05:13:06,000
*In the silence that follows, Koji tries to soothe his parched throat with another mouthful of weak coffee.*

2743
05:13:06,000 --> 05:13:09,000
Ryoko: "I see," Ryoko mutters. "So it is Saya."

2744
05:13:09,000 --> 05:13:13,000
*It's obvious that her grimace isn't for the coffee.*

2745
05:13:13,000 --> 05:13:20,000
Koji: "You know, don't you?" Koji asks, his tone almost confrontational. "You know what this 'Saya' is."

2746
05:13:20,000 --> 05:13:27,000
*Ryoko tries to ignore Koji's question by nursing her coffee, but that only works until the cup is empty.*

2747
05:13:27,000 --> 05:13:45,000
*Staring at the brown stain at the bottom of her cup, Ryoko says, her voice hard and flat, "You were foolish enough to ignore my warning once. But I'm just as stubborn as you, so I'm going to say this one more time. Go home, Tonoh, and forget everything that's happened."*

2748
05:13:45,000 --> 05:13:58,000
Koji: "You really are stubborn," Koji replies, smiling bitterly instead of glaring at her like he did before. "Are you saying that I still haven't crossed the line separating me from you and Fuminori?"

2749
05:13:58,000 --> 05:13:59,000
*Ryoko:*

2750
05:13:59,000 --> 05:14:03,000
*"You still haven't seen the most damning part of all this."*

2751
05:14:03,000 --> 05:14:12,000
Ryoko: "As far as you're concerned," Ryoko continues with a disparaging smirk, cannibal. That's all this thing is to you, isn't it?"

2752
05:14:12,000 --> 05:14:13,000
*That's all?*

2753
05:14:13,000 --> 05:14:28,000
*The things that Fuminori has done are so horrifying that Koji's only recourse, his only hope of coping, is to kill the man who was once his friend. Yet despite that, Ryoko makes this nightmare sound like just the beginning.*

2754
05:14:28,000 --> 05:14:34,000
*Koji still doesn't understand where her morbid cynicism comes from. Nor does he want to.*

2755
05:14:34,000 --> 05:14:39,000
Koji: "You say there's something more, but aren't you just imagining it?"

2756
05:14:39,000 --> 05:14:43,000
Ryoko: "See, that's how I know your wounds are still shallow."

2757
05:14:43,000 --> 05:14:50,000
*Her brusque tone says that she doesn't care whether or not Koji is satisfied with her explanation.*

2758
05:14:50,000 --> 05:14:57,000
Ryoko: "If you back out now, they'll probably heal, given time. You haven't crossed the final line yet."

2759
05:14:57,000 --> 05:15:03,000
*Koji considers Ryoko's words calmly, without letting himself get emotional like before.*

2760
05:15:03,000 --> 05:15:07,000
*The final line. True, Fuminori is somewhere beyond that.*

2761
05:15:07,000 --> 05:15:18,000
*Although Koji has gone far enough to be willing to kill Fuminori, he has no intention of eating his enemy's flesh once he's dead. That, at least, still separates the two.*

2762
05:15:18,000 --> 05:15:27,000
*Then what about Ryoko, who has treated Koji like an ignorant fool ever since she saved him from the well? How close is she to Fuminori?*

2763
05:15:27,000 --> 05:15:31,000
Koji: "You're saying your wounds are deeper than mine?"

2764
05:15:31,000 --> 05:15:36,000
*In response to Koji's biting question, Ryoko's mocking smile turns inward.*

2765
05:15:36,000 --> 05:15:39,000
Ryoko: "This gun was my father's, you know."

2766
05:15:39,000 --> 05:15:42,000
*Ryoko pats one of her duffle bag's bulges.*

2767
05:15:42,000 --> 05:15:56,000
Ryoko: "His hunting club kicked him out when it disappeared from his locker. I feel bad about that. My parents were always proud of me. They probably never even suspected that I was the one who took it."

2768
05:15:56,000 --> 05:15:59,000
Koji: "So you had a good reason for taking it?"

2769
05:15:59,000 --> 05:16:01,000
Ryoko: "No, not at all."

2770
05:16:01,000 --> 05:16:04,000
*Her quick denial isn't what Koji was expecting.*

2771
05:16:04,000 --> 05:16:19,000
Ryoko: "At the time, the Ogai mess had already ended -- at least, that's what I thought. He'd vanished without a trace, and I was sure I'd never see him again. I didn't steal this gun because I needed to shoot someone."

2772
05:16:19,000 --> 05:16:20,000
Koji: "Then why?"

2773
05:16:20,000 --> 05:16:23,000
Ryoko: "Because I couldn't sleep. That's all."

2774
05:16:23,000 --> 05:16:27,000
*Ryoko pauses, perhaps needing time to decide how best to explain.*

2775
05:16:27,000 --> 05:16:38,000
Ryoko: "Until then," she continues, choosing her words carefully, "I was sleeping with a machete next to my bed. I couldn't stand being alone at night, you see.

2776
05:16:38,000 --> 05:16:48,000
Ryoko: "I needed to know that no matter what horrors the world might hold, I still had some power against the madness. I needed a weapon I could count on."

2777
05:16:48,000 --> 05:16:49,000
Koji: "......"

2778
05:16:49,000 --> 05:17:01,000
*Koji doesn't know what to say. He's amazed -- impressed, even -- that someone with such a serious case of delusional paranoia could function as one of T University's top doctors.*

2779
05:17:01,000 --> 05:17:12,000
Ryoko: "It didn't work, though. My nightmares kept on getting worse. A machete just wasn't enough to let me sleep peacefully. That's when I stole my father's gun.

2780
05:17:12,000 --> 05:17:13,000
*Ryoko:*

2781
05:17:13,000 --> 05:17:32,000
*By cutting the barrel down like this, the shot spreads over a wider area and causes more damage. I hear that even in America, carrying a sawed-off shotgun is a serious crime. But with this gun sitting in the back of my closet, I was finally able to sleep. One night out of three, that is."*

2782
05:17:32,000 --> 05:17:53,000
*At this point, Ryoko seems to have gotten everything off of her chest. Smiling like someone who just finished a hard job, she adds, "A gun's a great thing to have, you know. It really is. You can use it to blow your enemies away, and if that doesn't work, you can always stick it in your mouth and pull the trigger."*

2783
05:17:53,000 --> 05:17:55,000
Koji: "Doctor... you need help."

2784
05:17:55,000 --> 05:18:03,000
Ryoko: "Thanks for the honest opinion. You won't be able to talk like that for much longer, though. Not if you go any further."

2785
05:18:03,000 --> 05:18:08,000
*Koji is already doubtful that meeting with Ryoko was the right thing to do.*

2786
05:18:08,000 --> 05:18:16,000
*The one thing that he and Ryoko have in common is an unwillingness to leave Fuminori to the proper authorities.*

2787
05:18:16,000 --> 05:18:27,000
*Fuminori not only killed Koji's lover and friend, but even went so far as to defile their corpses. Koji isn't about to give him the chance to get off on an insanity plea.*

2788
05:18:27,000 --> 05:18:36,000
*No matter what crimes he must commit, Koji will end Fuminori with his own two hands. If he doesn't, he knows that he will never sleep again.*

2789
05:18:36,000 --> 05:18:42,000
*It helps to have a partner-in-crime, but only when that partner doesn't cause trouble.*

2790
05:18:42,000 --> 05:18:52,000
*Ryoko talks big about exposing Ogai's secrets, but she might just have a head full of delusions. If so, Koji needs to rethink this whole thing.*

2791
05:18:52,000 --> 05:19:07,000
Koji: "If you're telling me to leave this to you," Koji says with unflappable determination, "then please give me some reason to trust you. Prove to me there's a reason for you to be so obsessed with Ogai. Show me what he did."

2792
05:19:07,000 --> 05:19:11,000
Ryoko: "So you're determined to go all the way? Oh well."

2793
05:19:11,000 --> 05:19:20,000
*Ryoko smirks and shakes her head ruefully, but puts up no futher resistance. She pulls a stack of paper from her bag and hands it to Koji.*

2794
05:19:20,000 --> 05:19:27,000
Ryoko: "After you read one line, it continues on the same line of the next page. Anyway, just skim it."

2795
05:19:27,000 --> 05:19:34,000
*As directed, Koji looks through the hand-written pages -- and gives up after less than three minutes.*

2796
05:19:34,000 --> 05:19:41,000
Koji: "Is this a manuscript for a horror novel or something? I didn't think Ogai had such childish hobbies."

2797
05:19:41,000 --> 05:19:58,000
*Koji deliberately scoffs at the document, doing everything he can to show contempt for what he just read. At the same time, he tries desperately not to remember the mountain of bones in Ogai's bathtub and the unidentifiable smell permeating Fuminori's house.*

2798
05:19:58,000 --> 05:20:07,000
Ryoko: "The specimens that Ogai brought to the hospital one year ago were just as unbelievable," Ryoko says, coldly ignoring Koji's disdain.

2799
05:20:07,000 --> 05:20:14,000
Ryoko:  without permission. But he made a mistake and was discovered. That's when things got crazy.

2800
05:20:14,000 --> 05:20:27,000
Ryoko: "Judging by the equipment he was trying to use, he meant to treat his experiment as a P3-level biohazard. To be honest, even that might not have been sufficient for what he was dealing with.

2801
05:20:27,000 --> 05:20:44,000
Ryoko: "We should have evacuated the nearby civilians, but the big shots did their thing and made the whole mess disappear. In exchange, we were left with the task of exterminating every single rat on campus -- including the things that used to be rats."

2802
05:20:44,000 --> 05:20:56,000
*At their first meeting, Ryoko brushed Koji off when he asked about Ogai Masahiko. Now, however, she's telling the whole story, her voice as flat and emotionless as a machine's.*

2803
05:20:56,000 --> 05:21:01,000
Ryoko: "In the end, everyone gave up trying to explain what had happened.

2804
05:21:01,000 --> 05:21:07,000
Ryoko: "No one could figure out where his materials had come from, or what they were.

2805
05:21:07,000 --> 05:21:15,000
Ryoko: "In retrospect, they did the wise thing. They knew how to keep the line between reality and fantasy where it should be.

2806
05:21:15,000 --> 05:21:18,000
Ryoko: "I, unfortunately, was not so wise."

2807
05:21:18,000 --> 05:21:25,000
*Ryoko pauses for a moment, then grins with self-disdain so maniacal that it strikes Koji like a blow.*

2808
05:21:25,000 --> 05:21:38,000
Ryoko: "I searched everywhere for Ogai, flushed him out, and finally learned what he'd been doing. I found the people he'd been dealing with and who'd encouraged him to perform his experiments.

2809
05:21:38,000 --> 05:21:47,000
Ryoko: "That's when I started sleeping with a machete. I'd learned just how absurd, how hollow, how worthless our precious 'reason' is."

2810
05:21:47,000 --> 05:21:48,000
Koji: "......"

2811
05:21:48,000 --> 05:21:59,000
*As though fleeing from the quiet insanity that he keeps glimpsing in Ryoko, Koji finds himself paging through the looseleaf in his hands. He reads a line at random.*

2812
05:21:59,000 --> 05:22:21,000
*"The organism's flesh is not fibrous, but reticulated. Put simply, it is an extremely tough substance that expands and contracts not in one direction, but in all directions. This means that slashing or piercing damage has very little effect. Since the flesh can contract in any direction freely, any wound will be sealed instantly..."*

2813
05:22:21,000 --> 05:22:23,000
*It's nonsense. What else can it be?*

2814
05:22:23,000 --> 05:22:32,000
*If he lets himself believe it, then everything else -- all the logical rules that define the world -- will be rendered meaningless.*

2815
05:22:32,000 --> 05:22:35,000
Koji: "Do you believe what's in this, Doctor?"

2816
05:22:35,000 --> 05:22:39,000
Ryoko: "I lost any reason to doubt it a long time ago."

2817
05:22:39,000 --> 05:22:48,000
*Ryoko reaches into her duffle bag again, this time removing a stainless steel thermos that looks able to hold about 500ccs of liquid.*

2818
05:22:48,000 --> 05:22:56,000
Ryoko: "This is the secret weapon that'll let us defeat Saya. It was a pain to get, but it should work like a charm."

2819
05:22:56,000 --> 05:23:08,000
Koji: "I can't take this anymore," Koji snaps, no longer able to disguise his frustration. "I don't care what Saya is! All I care about is killing Fuminori. I can't leave this to you."

2820
05:23:08,000 --> 05:23:09,000
Ryoko: "I see."

2821
05:23:09,000 --> 05:23:18,000
*Now that she's given up on persuading him, her assent is swift and cold. At this moment, Koji's fate has likely ceased to matter to her.*

2822
05:23:18,000 --> 05:23:31,000
Ryoko: "Alright, then. You do everything you can to take Sakisaka down. I'll take advantage of the opening you create. I won't get in your way, and I'll even take care of things when you screw up."

2823
05:23:31,000 --> 05:23:38,000
*Despite the determination in her voice, Koji can't bring himself to trust this paranoid doctor completely.*

2824
05:23:38,000 --> 05:23:41,000
Koji: "Do you have a reason to kill Fuminori?"

2825
05:23:41,000 --> 05:24:02,000
Ryoko: "I like things neat and tidy. I can't stand people like him who lurk outside of the world. They're like cockroaches in your bedroom. Can you sleep with them scuttling underneath your pillow? The moment I find one, I kill it and stamp out all trace of its existence. I have to, for the sake of my mental well-being."

2826
05:24:02,000 --> 05:24:05,000
*Her reasons are similar to Koji's own.*

2827
05:24:05,000 --> 05:24:36,000
*He doesn't want to bring a murderer to justice, nor does he want revenge for Omi and Yoh. If he did, he could have left everything to the police. The reason he can't is that the villain is Fuminori. The man he believed was his friend has turned his whole world upside down. Everything and everyone with a part in this madness is to blame, and that includes himself for allowing the betrayal. His self-loathing, his desire to destroy, is what's keeping him on his feet.*

2828
05:24:36,000 --> 05:24:41,000
Ryoko: "Okay, let's move in for the checkmate. Go ahead and call Sakisaka out."

2829
05:24:41,000 --> 05:24:48,000
*Koji nods, pulls out his cell phone, and calls his friend for what will probably be the last time.*

2830
05:24:48,000 --> 05:24:52,000
*The call goes through quickly. He must have been waiting for it.*

2831
05:24:52,000 --> 05:24:57,000
Koji: "Sorry to keep you waiting, Fuminori. I've finished my preparations."

2832
05:24:57,000 --> 05:24:59,000
Fuminori: "Koji. Where are you?"

2833
05:24:59,000 --> 05:25:06,000
*Fuminori must have been quite anxious to hear from Koji. His voice is hard and completely emotionless.*

2834
05:25:06,000 --> 05:25:09,000
Koji: "Let's just say I'm right behind you."

2835
05:25:09,000 --> 05:25:16,000
*Koji can't help but smile at Fuminori's disappointment. Perhaps Ryoko's maniacal sadism has rubbed off on him.*

2836
05:25:16,000 --> 05:25:19,000
Koji: "Well? Have you decided to let Tsukuba go?"

2837
05:25:19,000 --> 05:25:22,000
Fuminori: "Yeah. I suppose I have no choice."

2838
05:25:22,000 --> 05:25:27,000
*He's lying, Koji thinks, remembering the contents of Fuminori's refrigerator.*

2839
05:25:27,000 --> 05:25:33,000
*((Just what part of Yoh did you eat, Fuminori? Did you carve that poor girl up like a pig?))*

2840
05:25:33,000 --> 05:25:43,000
Fuminori: "Koji, bring your evidence along with all the files you've gathered. When I'm satisfied that they're the real thing, I'll hand Yoh over."

2841
05:25:43,000 --> 05:25:44,000
Koji: "Fine. Where?"

2842
05:25:44,000 --> 05:25:52,000
Fuminori: "First, come to Y Station on the O Line. When I'm sure that you're alone, I'll tell you the exact location."

2843
05:25:52,000 --> 05:25:54,000
Koji: "You're being awfully careful."

2844
05:25:54,000 --> 05:25:57,000
Fuminori: "No tricks. You have forty-five minutes."

2845
05:25:57,000 --> 05:26:01,000
*Fuminori hangs up without waiting for Koji's response.*

2846
05:26:01,000 --> 05:26:05,000
Koji: "He won't tell me his location until he's sure I'm alone."

2847
05:26:05,000 --> 05:26:09,000
Ryoko: "Not bad for a medical student. I'm impressed."

2848
05:26:09,000 --> 05:26:13,000
*Ryoko's praise sounds serious, drawing a glare from Koji.*

2849
05:26:13,000 --> 05:26:18,000
Ryoko: "We'll leave my car here. Is your trunk large enough for me to fit inside?"

2850
05:26:18,000 --> 05:26:22,000
Koji: "Yeah, but... are you serious? You've seen too many movies."

2851
05:26:22,000 --> 05:26:27,000
Ryoko: "This adventure is more dangerous than anything you've seen in a movie."

2852
05:26:27,000 --> 05:26:32,000
*With those bold words, Ryoko grabs her duffle bag and rises from her seat.*

2853
05:26:32,000 --> 05:26:35,000
Ryoko: "Weren't you the one who chose to meet here?"

2854
05:26:35,000 --> 05:26:36,000
Koji: "Yeah, why?"

2855
05:26:36,000 --> 05:26:41,000
Ryoko: "Take responsibility for the coffee," she says, and tosses him the check.

2856
05:26:41,000 --> 05:26:49,000
*Even after Koji arrives at Y Station as directed, Fuminori calls him and makes him change locations three more times.*

2857
05:26:49,000 --> 05:27:00,000
*Koji is beginning to doubt that Fuminori is trying to make sure that he's alone. He might just be using the time to guess when Koji arrives at each designated location.*

2858
05:27:00,000 --> 05:27:20,000
*Nevertheless, Koji can't let his guard down. Fuminori might choose any moment to make sure that he isn't bringing any help. If he makes a mistake and puts Fuminori on alert, Ryoko will lose her chance to take him by surprise. She'll just have to put up with the cramped trunk for a little while longer.*

2859
05:27:20,000 --> 05:27:33,000
*After the nature preserve and the dry riverbed, the fourth location to which Fuminori sends Koji is in the thick forest at the top of the foothills, high above the developed area at their base.*

2860
05:27:33,000 --> 05:27:41,000
*His car's GPS shows a road that leads nowhere, but according to Fuminori, there should be an old, abandoned sanatorium there.*

2861
05:27:41,000 --> 05:27:57,000
*The park and river were empty this late at night, but during the day would likely have considerable traffic. This time, however, his instinct is telling him that it's definitely a place that no one could find, not even by accident.*

2862
05:27:57,000 --> 05:28:00,000
*It looks like this is the final stop.*

2863
05:28:00,000 --> 05:28:13,000
*Koji drives up the steep incline, soon leaving the residential neighborhood behind. Even though the hands of progress are right at its doorstep, the undeveloped forest is darker than he expected.*

2864
05:28:13,000 --> 05:28:19,000
*This looks like a great place to live in secret -- or to kill someone and hide the body.*

2865
05:28:19,000 --> 05:28:30,000
*Places like this, lost and forgotten, aren't found only in deep jungles and hidden valleys. Holes in the world are everywhere, even in the midst of civilization.*

2866
05:28:30,000 --> 05:28:40,000
*A broken-down gatepost suddenly appears in the Accord's headlights like a ghost rising from the darkness. It looks like this is the final stop.*

2867
05:28:40,000 --> 05:28:47,000
*Koji rolls up to the gate and turns off the engine, giving himself to the silence of the forest.*

2868
05:28:47,000 --> 05:28:53,000
*His phone starts ringing almost immediately. He doesn't need to check who it's from.*

2869
05:28:53,000 --> 05:28:54,000
Koji: "I'm here."

2870
05:28:54,000 --> 05:28:58,000
Fuminori: "Yeah, I heard you. Welcome to my new home."

2871
05:28:58,000 --> 05:29:06,000
*Fuminori is nearby, close enough to hear the sound of the engine. A shiver of excitement shoots up Koji's spine.*

2872
05:29:06,000 --> 05:29:09,000
Fuminori: "Come inside. Yoh's waiting."

2873
05:29:09,000 --> 05:29:12,000
*Fuminori hangs up without another word.*

2874
05:29:12,000 --> 05:29:23,000
*After grabbing his new flashlight from the glove compartment and checking that his revolver is still in his pocket, Koji opens the door and gets out of the car.*

2875
05:29:23,000 --> 05:29:39,000
*After grabbing his new flashlight from the glove compartment and checking that the revolver is still in his pocket, Koji opens the door, making sure to pop the trunk at exactly the same time. Ryoko shouldn't need any more explanation than that.*

2876
05:29:39,000 --> 05:29:53,000
*Realizing that the interior roof light will stay on and broadcast that the trunk isn't closed, Koji quickly unscrews the bulb, then gets out of the car and deliberately slams the driver's side door hard.*

2877
05:29:53,000 --> 05:29:58,000
*Mountains of trash litter the front yard, forming a serviceable barricade.*

2878
05:29:58,000 --> 05:30:15,000
*Koji sees everything from small refrigerators and mopeds to huge chunks of concrete and plaster that must have been abandoned by construction workers. The fact that they could get away with leaving all this stuff behind shows just how remote this place is.*

2879
05:30:15,000 --> 05:30:29,000
*Glancing sidelong at the rear of his car, Koji sees no movement inside the barely-open trunk. Ryoko knows what she's doing. She'll probably wait until Fuminori's attention is focused on Koji before making her move.*

2880
05:30:29,000 --> 05:30:41,000
*The moon is brighter than usual, allowing Koji to walk through the front yard without tripping on debris. Staying alert, he heads for the building beyond the mountains of trash.*

2881
05:30:41,000 --> 05:30:49,000
*Something must be buried underneath the piles of garbage, because the whole yard is filled with the sharp stink of chemicals.*

2882
05:30:49,000 --> 05:30:59,000
*Even the homeless probably wouldn't come to this place. If you need to get out of the wind and rain, there are plenty of shelters more suitable.*

2883
05:30:59,000 --> 05:31:10,000
*When he reaches the gaping, doorless entrance to the building, Koji glances back the way he came. His Accord, parked at the gate, is hidden behind the mountains of trash.*

2884
05:31:10,000 --> 05:31:22,000
*Even if Fuminori is watching from inside the sanitorium, he shouldn't be able to see Ryoko crawl out of the trunk. It looks like she'll get her chance to take him by surprise.*

2885
05:31:22,000 --> 05:31:30,000
*How many times now has he stood like this, alone in some ominously silent place far removed from his everyday life?*

2886
05:31:30,000 --> 05:31:38,000
*Sneaking into deathly quiet houses to find traces of unimaginable happenings has become as normal as going to class.*

2887
05:31:38,000 --> 05:31:55,000
*The houses that he explored before were like freshly-shed cicada shells This place, however, is different -- a perfect ruin, its walls and pillars rising from the dark forest like an army of ghosts, with no sign at all that people once lived and worked here.*

2888
05:31:55,000 --> 05:32:05,000
*The structure resembles a skeleton more than a shell. Time and the elements have stripped it of its former shape, and now there is only death.*

2889
05:32:05,000 --> 05:32:09,000
*Koji has gone as far as he can. This must be the final stop.*

2890
05:32:09,000 --> 05:32:14,000
*What will Fuminori's next move be? He must be planning to kill Koji, but how?*

2891
05:32:14,000 --> 05:32:18,000
*Just as he's about to turn on his flashlight, Koji reconsiders.*

2892
05:32:18,000 --> 05:32:30,000
*If he wanders around with the light on, he'll be broadcasting his exact location. That will give the advantage to Fuminori, who's probably lying in wait for him right now.*

2893
05:32:30,000 --> 05:32:41,000
*He holds the light before him in his left hand with his finger poised on the switch. In his right hand, he raises the revolver, keeping it pointed in the same direction.*

2894
05:32:41,000 --> 05:32:47,000
*Now ready to fire when he turns on the light, Koji steps quietly into the dark ruin.*

2895
05:32:47,000 --> 05:32:59,000
*It takes a while for his eyes to adjust, but even when they do, he has only moonlight streaming through empty windows to guide him. Everything appears gray and indistinct.*

2896
05:32:59,000 --> 05:33:04,000
*However, Fuminori has to deal with the same conditions if he's hiding here.*

2897
05:33:04,000 --> 05:33:12,000
*This is a battle of nerves, exhausting and deadly, where the first to make a sound and give away his position will lose.*

2898
05:33:12,000 --> 05:33:25,000
*The rooms on both sides of the hallway are all open. Some are even missing their doors. Koji creeps up to each entrance, checks to make sure no one is inside, then carefully proceeds on.*

2899
05:33:25,000 --> 05:33:35,000
*The stink that he noticed in the garden has changed. Now it smells more organic, like rotting meat. It's the exact same smell that filled Fuminori's house.*

2900
05:33:35,000 --> 05:33:47,000
====================sy18_08ryokoscript.txt====================  ----The organism's flesh freely expands in a manner that renders piercing damage meaningless meaningless meaningless----

2901
05:33:47,000 --> 05:33:52,000
*Koji grits his teeth and forces the madman's words out of his head.*

2902
05:33:52,000 --> 05:33:58,000
*What good can come of taking them seriously? This isn't the time for such useless...*

2903
05:33:58,000 --> 05:33:59,000
*Squish.*

2904
05:33:59,000 --> 05:34:02,000
*Koji freezes and stares down the hall.*

2905
05:34:02,000 --> 05:34:12,000
*It was a wet sound that he heard just now, like someone dragging their feet through a swamp -- and it came from the room at the end of the hall.*

2906
05:34:12,000 --> 05:34:15,000
*Something is there -- something alive.*

2907
05:34:15,000 --> 05:34:19,000
*Koji creeps towards the sound, his light and gun at the ready.*

2908
05:34:19,000 --> 05:34:28,000
*Squish... squish. Now it sounds like someone squeezing mud through their fingers, and as he gets closer, Koji begins to hear breathing.*

2909
05:34:28,000 --> 05:34:36,000
*Could it be Fuminori? No, that's impossible. He should be waiting for a chance to ambush Koji, not making careless noise.*

2910
05:34:36,000 --> 05:34:43,000
*As he proceeds, the strange sound coming through the cracks in the concrete walls grows clearer.*

2911
05:34:43,000 --> 05:34:44,000
Yoh: "uH...uH...uH..."

2912
05:34:44,000 --> 05:34:54,000
*Before he knows it, he is standing on the threshold. The room is filled with a thick, viscous darkness, just like every other room that he's passed.*

2913
05:34:54,000 --> 05:34:58,000
*There is more than just darkness, however. Something is there.*

2914
05:34:58,000 --> 05:35:04,000
*He can hear pained breathing, like that of a wounded animal, and what sounds like sobbing.*

2915
05:35:04,000 --> 05:35:05,000
*Sobbing?*

2916
05:35:05,000 --> 05:35:09,000
Koji: "Who's there?" Koji whispers into the darkness.

2917
05:35:09,000 --> 05:35:20,000
*Now that he's given away his position, he might as well turn on his light. For some reason, however, Koji feels that to do so would have disastrous consequences.*

2918
05:35:20,000 --> 05:35:25,000
*((Sobbing... the last time I heard her voice, on the phone, she was sobbing...))*

2919
05:35:25,000 --> 05:35:27,000
*The wheezing suddenly stops.*

2920
05:35:27,000 --> 05:35:28,000
*And then...*

2921
05:35:28,000 --> 05:35:29,000
Yoh: "Ko...Ji?"

2922
05:35:29,000 --> 05:35:38,000
*A whisper comes out of the darkness. Though not a human voice -- not by any measure -- it speaks some blasphemous semblance of human words.*

2923
05:35:38,000 --> 05:35:42,000
*A nightmarish flash of insight connects the dots in Koji's mind.*

2924
05:35:42,000 --> 05:35:43,000
Koji: "Tsukuba?"

2925
05:35:43,000 --> 05:35:44,000
*It can't be.*

2926
05:35:44,000 --> 05:35:48,000
*Yoh doesn't sound like this. She doesn't smell like this.*

2927
05:35:48,000 --> 05:35:51,000
Yoh: "pLeAse... KoJi... KilL... mE..."

2928
05:35:51,000 --> 05:35:57,000
*But if it's not Yoh, then how does it know his name? Why is it begging him for help?*

2929
05:35:57,000 --> 05:36:03,000
*No. It can't be Yoh. She's human, not some creature that slithers and hides in the shadows.*

2930
05:36:03,000 --> 05:36:07,000
Yoh: "It HurTs... tHis BoDy... aLWayS HurTs... SaVe mE... KoJi..."

2931
05:36:07,000 --> 05:36:17,000
*The thing wriggles closer. His reason cries out, imploring him to switch the light on before it's too late -- or to turn and run, if he cannot.*

2932
05:36:17,000 --> 05:36:24,000
*But Koji is unable to make either choice. He can only call out in vain to the amorphous shape in the darkness.*

2933
05:36:24,000 --> 05:36:27,000
Koji: "Is it you, Tsukuba? Is it really you!?"

2934
05:36:27,000 --> 05:36:31,000
Yoh: "LeT Me dIe... No... MorE... PleAse... KilL meeEE!"

2935
05:36:31,000 --> 05:36:34,000
*Something soft and slimy slides over Koji's toes.*

2936
05:36:34,000 --> 05:36:40,000
*Instinct overrides his will, forcing him to turn on his light and shine it at his feet.*

2937
05:36:40,000 --> 05:36:50,000
*The white beam reveals everything -- the merciless truth that finally shatters Koji's sanity. VC_PLAY(2,"voice/40/001202",0,100,false,"Koji");*

2938
05:36:50,000 --> 05:36:52,000
*responds with instant obedience.*

2939
05:36:52,000 --> 05:37:02,000
*There is a burst of tremendous light and sound, both more intense than he expected, and then the destructive forces are swallowed up by the darkness.*

2940
05:37:02,000 --> 05:37:08,000
*His ears are still ringing from the bang, but he hears a weak voice coming from the shadows.*

2941
05:37:08,000 --> 05:37:09,000
Yoh: "iT... HuRts..."

2942
05:37:09,000 --> 05:37:17,000
Koji: "Koji screams and pulls the trigger again and again, believing that salvation can come only from the barrel of his gun.

2943
05:37:17,000 --> 05:37:29,000
*Light and darkness, explosion and silence -- they dance their dance three more times. Koji doesn't even need to aim. The horrible creature is right at his feet, far too close to miss.*

2944
05:37:29,000 --> 05:37:37,000
*Ryoko warned him how many bullets were left in the revolver, but that information has already been driven from his mind.*

2945
05:37:37,000 --> 05:37:49,000
*Even after the cold, heavy gloom wraps itself around him once more, Koji keeps pulling the trigger like a man possessed, paying no heed to the clicking of the empty weapon.*

2946
05:37:49,000 --> 05:38:04,000
*His panic-stricken legs suddenly give out, sending him down hard on his backside. Even then, he keeps firing the empty gun. He knows no other way to erase the memory of the thing that he glimpsed in the beam of his flashlight.*

2947
05:38:04,000 --> 05:38:17,000
*The light, which fell from his hand during the attack, is now pointing in a completely different direction. And though all four bullets must have hit their target, they were Koji's last card to play.*

2948
05:38:17,000 --> 05:38:24,000
*Which leaves him alone in the darkness with no way to defend himself. And just as he realizes this...*

2949
05:38:24,000 --> 05:38:28,000
*A mass of rotting flesh rolls onto him like a tidal wave.*

2950
05:38:28,000 --> 05:38:32,000
Yoh: "ItHurtsIthuRTsithurtsIThurtsitHURTSIThURTSITHURTSSSSS!!"

2951
05:38:32,000 --> 05:38:37,000
*He can no longer even scream as the thing pushes him onto his back.*

2952
05:38:37,000 --> 05:38:46,000
Koji: "With fear seizing his throat in an iron grip, Koji struggles desperately against the monster as it crawls up his body towards his face.

2953
05:38:46,000 --> 05:38:55,000
*Covering his face with his left hand, he scrabbles wildly along the floor with his right, searching for a way out that doesn't exist.*

2954
05:38:55,000 --> 05:39:00,000
*His mind is that of a feral animal, empty of everything but primal terror.*

2955
05:39:00,000 --> 05:39:09,000
*And that is why, when his right hand closes around something hard at the last moment, he recognizes it instinctively as a weapon.*

2956
05:39:09,000 --> 05:39:16,000
*Putting every ounce of strength into his arm, Koji swings the heavy object at the creature on top of him.*

2957
05:39:16,000 --> 05:39:23,000
*He hears the thud of a blunt object striking something soft and wet, and then Koji's attacker rolls off him.*

2958
05:39:23,000 --> 05:39:37,000
*As soon as he is able to move freely, Koji leaps to his feet and grabs his new weapon with both hands, brandishing it like a charm to ward off evil. Only now does he realize that he's holding a rusty steel pipe.*

2959
05:39:37,000 --> 05:39:38,000
Yoh: "eE...Ee...eE..."

2960
05:39:38,000 --> 05:39:40,000
*The monster is still sobbing.*

2961
05:39:40,000 --> 05:39:41,000
Koji: "AHHHHHHH!!"

2962
05:39:41,000 --> 05:39:51,000
*With a cry that is part terrified scream, part enraged roar, Koji raises the steel pipe and brings it crashing down on the cowering creature.*

2963
05:39:51,000 --> 05:40:05,000
*He hears a wet sound and feels the blood-chilling sensation of its thick, soft flesh absorbing the blow. These combine to evoke an instinctive loathing that wipes his mind of all but the urge to destroy.*

2964
05:40:05,000 --> 05:40:06,000
Koji: "Die! DIE!!"

2965
05:40:06,000 --> 05:40:14,000
*Consumed by the same desperation with which he kept firing the empty gun, Koji rains blow after blow down on his enemy.*

2966
05:40:14,000 --> 05:40:27,000
*After the tenth blow, it stops sobbing; after the twentieth blow, it stops moving; and after the thirtieth blow, it begins to feel and sound more and more like he's beating a puddle of viscous liquid.*

2967
05:40:27,000 --> 05:40:39,000
*Koji doesn't stop thrashing the creature until he recovers enough of his senses to realize that whatever it might have been before, it is now nothing but a lifeless corpse.*

2968
05:40:39,000 --> 05:40:46,000
*The pipe in his hand, covered with unidentifiable fluids and filth, suddenly feels unbearably heavy.*

2969
05:40:46,000 --> 05:40:50,000
Ryoko: "You still haven't seen the most damning part of all this."

2970
05:40:50,000 --> 05:41:02,000
*Ryoko's voice plays back in his head, and at last he knows how merciful her warning was. Now that his eyes are as open as hers, he is able to laugh in contempt of his own foolishness.*

2971
05:41:02,000 --> 05:41:11,000
*Twenty years of memories in the light of the sun -- if they were indeed precious to him, then he should never have come to this place.*

2972
05:41:11,000 --> 05:41:28,000
*The black flames of despair rise within him, consuming fear and revulsion and pity. Only rage and hate remain. Every cell in his body cries out for vengeance, for the blood of the man who poisoned him with truth and tore him from the womb of innocence.*

2973
05:41:28,000 --> 05:41:33,000
*And then Koji, slave to hate, hears the sound of someone sneaking up behind him.*

2974
05:41:33,000 --> 05:41:38,000
*Koji whirls, swinging his steel pipe with all the force he can muster.*

2975
05:41:38,000 --> 05:41:49,000
*His enemy hastily leaps back to avoid the strike, surprised by his failure to catch Koji off guard. Twisted shadows dance in the beam of the light on the floor.*

2976
05:41:49,000 --> 05:41:54,000
*Readying his pipe for the next blow, Koji faces off against his second attacker.*

2977
05:41:54,000 --> 05:41:56,000
Koji: "Sakisaka... Fuminori!"

2978
05:41:56,000 --> 05:42:03,000
*Before this moment, Koji could not have imagined that he would speak his friend's name with such hatred.*

2979
05:42:03,000 --> 05:42:09,000
Fuminori: "Hey, that was a pretty heavy swing just now. You trying to kill me or something?"

2980
05:42:09,000 --> 05:42:15,000
*Even now, Fuminori is smiling, as though the huge axe in his hands is just a sick joke.*

2981
05:42:15,000 --> 05:42:18,000
Fuminori: "Damn, Koji. I thought you'd hesitate."

2982
05:42:18,000 --> 05:42:21,000
Koji: "You thought I'd hesitate? Against you!?"

2983
05:42:21,000 --> 05:42:25,000
*Koji sneers too, unable to contain his contempt for the notion.*

2984
05:42:25,000 --> 05:42:34,000
Koji: "How did you kill Omi, you piece of shit? What did you do to Tsukuba? After all this, you expect me to think twice about killing you?"

2985
05:42:34,000 --> 05:42:48,000
Fuminori: "That's my line, Koji," Fuminori growls, looking sadly at the pile of dead flesh at Koji's feet. "How could you do such a horrible thing to Yoh? You'll taste ten times her pain before I kill you."

2986
05:42:48,000 --> 05:42:57,000
*The blade of Fuminori's axe carves a murderous arc through the darkness, glittering menacingly in the faint light coming from the floor.*

2987
05:42:57,000 --> 05:43:07,000
*Koji raises his pipe to block the ferocious swing. The heavy impact numbs his arms, but his large frame takes the blow without giving any ground.*

2988
05:43:07,000 --> 05:43:25,000
*Fuminori presses the attack, delivering a second blow and a third. His axe, designed for chopping down trees, is deadlier and more durable than the piece of pipe Koji found discarded on the floor. Each strike Koji blocks sends chunks of rust flying from his makeshift weapon.*

2989
05:43:25,000 --> 05:43:31,000
*He can't win as long as he's on the defensive. He needs to create an opportunity to attack.*

2990
05:43:31,000 --> 05:43:32,000
Koji: "Bastard!"

2991
05:43:32,000 --> 05:43:45,000
*Koji blocks a crushing downward swing, then pushes back hard before Fuminori can pull away, throwing him off balance. Fuminori stumbles backwards, then plants his feet to steady himself.*

2992
05:43:45,000 --> 05:43:53,000
*Taking advantage of his opponent's temporary immobility, Koji delivers a punishing low kick to Fuminori's outer thigh.*

2993
05:43:53,000 --> 05:43:54,000
Fuminori: "Guh!"

2994
05:43:54,000 --> 05:44:01,000
*Fuminori grunts and retreats, swinging his axe wildly to prevent Koji from following up with another attack.*

2995
05:44:01,000 --> 05:44:09,000
*Koji, however, does not press his advantage. He just stands where he is, calmly spearing Fuminori with his stare.*

2996
05:44:09,000 --> 05:44:12,000
Koji: "You've never been in a fight, have you?"

2997
05:44:12,000 --> 05:44:20,000
Fuminori: "Fuminori roars and comes in for another attack, but the damage to his right leg seems to be slowing his swing.

2998
05:44:20,000 --> 05:44:26,000
*Easily blocking the axe with his pipe, Koji waits for Fuminori to exhaust himself.*

2999
05:44:26,000 --> 05:44:27,000
Fuminori: "Die! Die!!"

3000
05:44:27,000 --> 05:44:38,000
*Fuminori delivers blow after heavy blow, howling savagely all the while. What he does not realize, however, is that the situation now favors composure, not brute force.*

3001
05:44:38,000 --> 05:44:53,000
*When Fuminori raises his axe high for yet another attack, Koji sees that his movements have grown dull enough. Seizing the opportunity, Koji charges into Fuminori's range and grabs the haft of the axe with his left hand.*

3002
05:44:53,000 --> 05:44:54,000
Fuminori: "!?"

3003
05:44:54,000 --> 05:45:00,000
*As Fuminori recoils in fear, Koji brings his pipe crashing into his enemy's unprotected side.*

3004
05:45:00,000 --> 05:45:03,000
*He feels the crunch of ribs breaking.*

3005
05:45:03,000 --> 05:45:04,000
Fuminori: "Gah!"

3006
05:45:04,000 --> 05:45:16,000
*The pain drives Fuminori to his knees. Staring down at Fuminori's defenseless head, Koji, surprised by his own lack of emotion, raises his pipe high to deliver the finishing blow.*

3007
05:45:16,000 --> 05:45:20,000
*Which is when something wraps itself around his left ankle.*

3008
05:45:20,000 --> 05:45:21,000
Koji: "What!?"

3009
05:45:21,000 --> 05:45:32,000
*The instant Koji panics at the unexpected sensation, something soft yet strong winds itself around his right leg and drags him to the floor before he can resist.*

3010
05:45:32,000 --> 05:45:42,000
*He twists his body and tries to swing the steel pipe at the unseen enemy behind him, but his right hand, too, is seized by the same flexible force.*

3011
05:45:42,000 --> 05:45:52,000
*He wasn't able to feel it through his pants, but now his blood turns to ice at the cold, slimy sensation of the thing wrapped around his uncovered wrist.*

3012
05:45:52,000 --> 05:45:54,000
*((That monster's still alive!?))*

3013
05:45:54,000 --> 05:46:05,000
Fuminori: "That's it... Saya," Fuminori says encouragingly. Even while kneeling on the floor, his face twisted in pain, he manages a terrible, victorious grin.

3014
05:46:05,000 --> 05:46:06,000
*Saya.*

3015
05:46:06,000 --> 05:46:08,000
*This monster is Saya.*

3016
05:46:08,000 --> 05:46:14,000
*Koji struggles desperately to free himself from the creature's slimy grip,<PRE></PRE>*

3017
05:46:14,000 --> 05:46:15,000
Koji: "AHHHHHHHH!"

3018
05:46:15,000 --> 05:46:24,000
*The horror has already driven Koji half mad. Just imagining the creature's appearance is enough to send him into a mindless panic.*

3019
05:46:24,000 --> 05:46:38,000
*His scream is suddenly cut off as a slimy appendage seizes his throat. This most deadly tentacle isn't just cutting off his windpipe. It's trying to snap his neck... and it's getting tighter. FLASH_N(0xff0000,1);*

3020
05:46:38,000 --> 05:46:43,000
*My mind hazy from the pain, I watch as Saya feasts upon her slain prey.*

3021
05:46:43,000 --> 05:46:50,000
*We've won. It was hard, and I wasn't able to do it alone, but together we have defeated our enemy.*

3022
05:46:50,000 --> 05:46:58,000
*The price was steep. At least two of my ribs are broken, sending a sharp pain shooting through my chest every time I breathe.*

3023
05:46:58,000 --> 05:47:09,000
*And then there's Yoh. I didn't expect her to fall to Koji so easily. I suppose that, unlike Saya, she might have been unfamiliar with how to use her new body in combat.*

3024
05:47:09,000 --> 05:47:24,000
*My injury must have fueled Saya's anger. Her slaughter of Koji was merciless and complete. As soon as her prey stopped moving, she sank her teeth into his vital organs and ruthlessly extinguished the last embers of life.*

3025
05:47:24,000 --> 05:47:43,000
*Though her brutal, grisly actions were unbecoming of her girlish appearance, Saya's face, covered in blood and gore, was that of a victorious queen of beasts lording over her defeated foe. There was something noble and sacred about her primal ferocity that made me reluctant to disturb her.*

3026
05:47:43,000 --> 05:47:53,000
*I don't know how long I've been sitting here watching Saya feast. I've nearly fainted from the pain several times. To be honest, I'm not used to violence.*

3027
05:47:53,000 --> 05:48:04,000
*The wounds I suffered in the car accident were worse, of course, but these broken ribs are the most severe injury that's ever been deliberately inflicted upon me.*

3028
05:48:04,000 --> 05:48:14,000
*You'd think that Saya could show a little more concern for my condition. Koji is already as dead as can be, so there's no reason for her to be so greedy.*

3029
05:48:14,000 --> 05:48:21,000
*I suddenly realize that Saya has stopped eating. Now she's lying on her back, rolling from side to side.*

3030
05:48:21,000 --> 05:48:34,000
*Has she eaten too much? It's been several days since we've had fresh, unfrozen meat, so I understand where her enthusiasm is coming from. But still, I'm wounded here. She could give me a hand.*

3031
05:48:34,000 --> 05:48:40,000
*Because I'm preoccupied with my own selfish wants, I'm slow to realize that something is wrong.*

3032
05:48:40,000 --> 05:48:43,000
*Saya isn't resting. She's trembling -- in agony.*

3033
05:48:43,000 --> 05:48:48,000
*My blood goes cold, and the pain from my broken ribs is suddenly forgotten.*

3034
05:48:48,000 --> 05:48:49,000
Fuminori: "Saya!?"

3035
05:48:49,000 --> 05:48:54,000
*I jump up, run to her side, and cradle her fallen body in my arms.*

3036
05:48:54,000 --> 05:49:02,000
*Her face is pale and drenched in sweat, and her half-closed eyelids and lips are shivering like she has a fever.*

3037
05:49:02,000 --> 05:49:09,000
*What's going on? Was she wounded in the fight? Could the meat she just ate have been poisoned somehow?*

3038
05:49:09,000 --> 05:49:14,000
*I don't understand. All I know is that something terrible is happening.*

3039
05:49:14,000 --> 05:49:16,000
Fuminori: "Saya! Saya!"

3040
05:49:16,000 --> 05:49:20,000
*The only thing I can do is call her name with all of my strength.*

3041
05:49:20,000 --> 05:49:24,000
*Saya slowly opens her eyes and gazes vacantly into my face.*

3042
05:49:24,000 --> 05:49:29,000
Saya: "Sorry... Fuminori. I'm fine... really... It just... hurts a little."

3043
05:49:29,000 --> 05:49:33,000
Fuminori: "What's wrong!? What is it!? Come on, Saya!"

3044
05:49:33,000 --> 05:49:38,000
*There's no way she's fine. It's glaringly obvious that her condition is dire.*

3045
05:49:38,000 --> 05:49:49,000
*Even so, I'm the only one who's panicking. Saya's expression is serene, as though she understands everything that is happening to her. She even smiles softly up at me.*

3046
05:49:49,000 --> 05:49:54,000
Saya: "I can't believe it. I never thought... the time would come... so soon."

3047
05:49:54,000 --> 05:50:04,000
*I might lose Saya. The thought is unbearable. Terror and despair are quickly overwhelming me, a feeling of utter helplessness that I cannot resist.*

3048
05:50:04,000 --> 05:50:10,000
Saya: "Don't be afraid. Remember what I said? This is... the sign. This is... our only hope..."

3049
05:50:10,000 --> 05:50:15,000
Fuminori: "What are you talking about!? I don't understand! Stay with me, Saya!"

3050
05:50:15,000 --> 05:50:21,000
*Saya answers my tearful entreaty with a smile like that of a mother comforting her child.*

3051
05:50:21,000 --> 05:50:26,000
Saya: "I did it... I decided to do my best. After all... you said you loved me.

3052
05:50:26,000 --> 05:50:29,000
Saya: "You said... that I was pretty."

3053
05:50:29,000 --> 05:50:31,000
Fuminori: "Stop this, Saya!"

3054
05:50:31,000 --> 05:50:37,000
*Whatever is happening, I can't just sit by and watch as it causes Saya such agony.*

3055
05:50:37,000 --> 05:50:42,000
Fuminori: "Please! Whatever you're trying to do, I don't want to see you suffer!"

3056
05:50:42,000 --> 05:50:47,000
Saya: "Don't be like that, Fuminori..." Saya chides me. "Please understand."

3057
05:50:47,000 --> 05:50:50,000
*In a soft voice, she reveals her secret.*

3058
05:50:50,000 --> 05:50:53,000
Saya: "They're going to be born... our children."

3059
05:50:53,000 --> 05:50:56,000
*For a moment, my mind goes completely blank.*

3060
05:50:56,000 --> 05:50:59,000
Fuminori: "What? But... when did you?"

3061
05:50:59,000 --> 05:51:01,000
Saya: "I'm surprised too. Fuminori?"

3062
05:51:01,000 --> 05:51:10,000
*Saya's labored breathing speaks to the terrible pain her tiny body is suffering -- even so, she wraps her arms tightly around my neck.*

3063
05:51:10,000 --> 05:51:14,000
Saya: "Take me outside... to an open place... under the sky."

3064
05:51:14,000 --> 05:51:25,000
*I nod. What else can I do? If I speak, I'm afraid that I'll be unable to hold back my tears. I mustn't cry -- not when Saya is facing her torment so bravely.*

3065
05:51:25,000 --> 05:51:36,000
*It feels like Saya is burning up in my arms, and I fear that the terrible convulsions that shoot through her at intervals will tear her frail body to pieces.*

3066
05:51:36,000 --> 05:51:42,000
*Praying for her safety, I scoop Saya up and carry her swiftly out of the ruined building.*

3067
05:51:42,000 --> 05:51:52,000
*Maybe the cold night air will soothe her fever -- but that hope is futile, cruelly dashed as her breathing grows shallow and she moans through bluish lips.*

3068
05:51:52,000 --> 05:51:54,000
Fuminori: "Saya... we're outside."

3069
05:51:54,000 --> 05:51:58,000
*In response to my call, she opens her eyes once more.*

3070
05:51:58,000 --> 05:52:02,000
*Her gaze is cloudy and unfocused. She can no longer see.*

3071
05:52:02,000 --> 05:52:09,000
*Nevertheless, Saya looks at me. I can tell that she is imagining my expression where my face should be.*

3072
05:52:09,000 --> 05:52:13,000
Saya: "Just as I promised... this is... my final present."

3073
05:52:13,000 --> 05:52:14,000
Fuminori: "I know."

3074
05:52:14,000 --> 05:52:16,000
Saya: "I hope you'll... like it..."

3075
05:52:16,000 --> 05:52:18,000
Fuminori: "Of course I will!"

3076
05:52:18,000 --> 05:52:31,000
*It takes every ounce of my willpower, but I manage to make my voice light and cheerful. In Saya's mind's eye, I know that I am smiling. She won't have to see my face streaked with tears.*

3077
05:52:31,000 --> 05:52:35,000
Saya: "Fuminori... to you, who loved me... I give... this planet."

3078
05:52:35,000 --> 05:52:41,000
*Saya's whisper is weak and pained, but there is ecstasy in her voice -- ecstasy, and joy.*

3079
05:52:41,000 --> 05:52:44,000
*Her back suddenly shifts, then bulges outward.*

3080
05:52:44,000 --> 05:52:50,000
Saya: "This world... will be beautiful," she whispers in exultation. "A world... just for us."

3081
05:52:50,000 --> 05:52:53,000
*And then, Saya blooms. How else can I describe it?*

3082
05:52:53,000 --> 05:53:07,000
*Flower petals -- long and wide, they spread from her back like the wings of a newly-formed butterfly. Their brilliant glow comes from the countless tiny scales that cover each petal like particles of light.*

3083
05:53:07,000 --> 05:53:13,000
Fuminori: "Is this goodbye?" I ask her, careful to keep the sorrow out of my voice.

3084
05:53:13,000 --> 05:53:16,000
Saya: "No... not goodbye. This is... the beginning."

3085
05:53:16,000 --> 05:53:22,000
*Saya's pain must already have left her, for her expression is infinitely peaceful and content.*

3086
05:53:22,000 --> 05:53:25,000
Saya: "The beginning... of our world."

3087
05:53:25,000 --> 05:53:31,000
*The radiant motes rise on the wind, painting rivers of light in the frozen winter sky.*

3088
05:53:31,000 --> 05:53:47,000
*It is beautiful -- overwhelmingly, painfully beautiful. Singing victoriously of their freedom, the shining seeds of life are released into this vast and fertile land. Their song heralds the coming of the new world and the destruction of the old.*

3089
05:53:47,000 --> 05:53:49,000
*It is a boundless healing.*

3090
05:53:49,000 --> 05:53:51,000
*It is an eternal blessing.*

3091
05:53:51,000 --> 05:53:54,000
*We shall fill the world with our joy.*

3092
05:53:54,000 --> 05:53:57,000
Fuminori: "Now we'll be together forever, won't we?"

3093
05:53:57,000 --> 05:54:04,000
*Embracing Saya's pitifully shrunken body, I gaze into the shining sky and let my tears flow freely.*

3094
05:54:04,000 --> 05:54:05,000
*Thank you.*

3095
05:54:05,000 --> 05:54:08,000
*Thank you for this final gift, Saya.*

3096
05:54:08,000 --> 05:54:18,000
*She was worried, at first, how long the preserved foods in the underground storeroom would last her, but now it seems that her fears were unfounded.*

3097
05:54:18,000 --> 05:54:21,000
*It's the liquor she should have worried about.*

3098
05:54:21,000 --> 05:54:34,000
*By savoring each drop of Spirytus as though it were her last, she thought that she could make her flask hold out a little longer -- but she must have been consuming more each day than she realized.*

3099
05:54:34,000 --> 05:54:43,000
*Who can blame her? There is no way that she could have gotten through this without the intoxicating effects of distilled alcohol.*

3100
05:54:43,000 --> 05:54:52,000
*After Ryoko chased useless emotions like hope and despair from her mind, she found herself spending the most peaceful days of her life.*

3101
05:54:52,000 --> 05:55:03,000
*As resignation set in, even hate and fear left her. Now she feels only awe for what Ogai Masahiko did and respect for the depth of his intellectual curiosity.*

3102
05:55:03,000 --> 05:55:08,000
*After all, neither she nor this world has any reason left to deny his research.*

3103
05:55:08,000 --> 05:55:15,000
*Alone in the mountain cabin, Ryoko killed time by bringing order to the documents that Ogai had left behind.*

3104
05:55:15,000 --> 05:55:25,000
*She took the scattered, enciphered papers and rewrote them in a more readable fashion, eliminating redundancies and adding indexes and tables of contents.*

3105
05:55:25,000 --> 05:55:32,000
*Ryoko did not intend for anyone to read them, of course. She knew full well how meaningless her actions were.*

3106
05:55:32,000 --> 05:55:39,000
*With her reason to live gone, however, having something to devote her mind to was at least some relief.*

3107
05:55:39,000 --> 05:55:55,000
*And now, as the last congratulatory drops of Spirytus vodka burn their way down Ryoko's throat, all of Ogai's research lies before her in a single volume. She has finally finished transcribing and annotating the last of his writings.*

3108
05:55:55,000 --> 05:56:03,000
*Enjoying the satisfaction of a pointless job well done, she idly pages through the manuscript that she just completed.*

3109
05:56:03,000 --> 05:56:08,000
*"I shall conclude by summarizing my theory as it currently stands.*

3110
05:56:08,000 --> 05:56:21,000
*The lifeform that I named Saya did not appear in our universe by chance, nor even as a result of my summoning, but because of the instincts that were programmed directly into her biology.*

3111
05:56:21,000 --> 05:56:27,000
She was created to fulfill the same ultimate purpose that all life shares: reproduction.

3112
05:56:27,000 --> 05:56:32,000
*Saya and her kind procreate by spreading their seeds to other dimensions."*

3113
05:56:32,000 --> 05:56:45,000
*"What is the probability that they will discover a doorway to another world? Even if they succeed in doing so, the chance of that world being suitable for reproduction must be even more minute.*

3114
05:56:45,000 --> 05:56:57,000
*In order to make the most of that scant probability, evolution has granted them a certain advantage -- none other than the astonishing ability that I have witnessed in Saya.*

3115
05:56:57,000 --> 05:57:10,000
*To wit, they select the most prosperous lifeform that they encounter, take control of it, and in doing so gain dominance over that planet's biosphere. In other words, they 'hijack' the entire species.*

3116
05:57:10,000 --> 05:57:24,000
*They do this by analyzing their target's genome, then overwriting its genetic code to remake it in their own image. Saya's biology is more than capable of inducing such dramatic and widespread mutation."*

3117
05:57:24,000 --> 05:57:36,000
*"There is a significant probability that the target species will have evolved into intelligent life. This element may be necessary to gaining control of the planet's environment.*

3118
05:57:36,000 --> 05:57:53,000
*Therefore, Saya and her sisters also plunder their target's culture and psychology. Her extraordinary learning ability and intellectual curiosity are likely instinctive tools that enable her to inherit the target species's entire wealth of knowledge."*

3119
05:57:53,000 --> 05:57:59,000
*"In fact, it may be that Saya's kind has always had its sights set on intelligent life.*

3120
05:57:59,000 --> 05:58:27,000
*Perhaps they wait patiently for some foolish, extradimensional species to gain knowledge of other worlds and, in attempting to satisfy its curiosity, make contact with the outer universe in which they dwell. Rather than send Saya and her kin on their dimensional journeys with only luck and their own strength to depend on, would not waiting for such contact greatly increase the chance of finding a world worthy of conquest?*

3121
05:58:27,000 --> 05:58:41,000
*Just as I, having acquired the Silver Key, fancied myself an explorer of the unknown -- how many intelligent lifeforms on other worlds have thoughtlessly congratulated themselves for 'discovering' Saya's sisters?"*

3122
05:58:41,000 --> 05:58:51,000
*Taken by the sudden urge to go outside for a change, Ryoko gathers up the manuscript and heads to her car, which is parked in the front yard.*

3123
05:58:51,000 --> 05:59:00,000
*She has completed her self-imposed final duty. There is no longer any reason for her to remain holed up in the mountain cabin.*

3124
05:59:00,000 --> 05:59:07,000
*She drives a little farther up the mountain, to an open place that offers a scenic view of the land below.*

3125
05:59:07,000 --> 05:59:14,000
*In the early days of the change, Ryoko often came to this spot to watch helplessly over the mutating city.*

3126
05:59:14,000 --> 05:59:19,000
*"The one flaw in my theory comes from none other than Saya herself.*

3127
05:59:19,000 --> 05:59:32,000
*After using me to learn everything she could about humanity, Saya should finally have been prepared to begin the last stage of her invasion. However, she never carried out her mission. Why?"*

3128
05:59:32,000 --> 05:59:36,000
*"I hypothesize... that Saya was an irregular among her kind.*

3129
05:59:36,000 --> 05:59:50,000
*It is said that the human race's intelligence has allowed us to conquer our natural instincts. Perhaps, in absorbing the human psyche, Saya accidentally inherited the disease that infects our entire species."*

3130
05:59:50,000 --> 05:59:58,000
*"What is human love, really? What behavior could be more of a hindrance to the efficient propagation of a species?*

3131
05:59:58,000 --> 06:00:07,000
*I am reminded of how, at the end of her studies, Saya consumed vast quantities of romantic literature from all over the world.*

3132
06:00:07,000 --> 06:00:19,000
*She tried to understand romance as an integral part of the human reproductive process. As a result, she might have unwittingly neutered her own unparalleled reproductive abilities.*

3133
06:00:19,000 --> 06:00:22,000
*After all... she had not known love."*

3134
06:00:22,000 --> 06:00:39,000
*"She had come to this world to rule it in our place, and had studied humanity to fulfill that purpose -- but ultimately, she could not share love with a human. Without love's blessing, Saya was unable to find the passion to fill this world with her kind.*

3135
06:00:39,000 --> 06:00:52,000
*In learning all that there was to know about humanity, she herself had become hopelessly human. Weary of loneliness, she despaired of the world. How pure her maiden's soul must have been.*

3136
06:00:52,000 --> 06:01:03,000
*If this hypothesis is correct, then it means that I have failed as her teacher. I cannot help but feel ashamed for having spoiled such an extraordinary organism."*

3137
06:01:03,000 --> 06:01:09,000
*Saya. Next to Ogai Masahiko, Ryoko now knows more about that entity than anyone else.*

3138
06:01:09,000 --> 06:01:16,000
*No... when the young man named Sakisaka Fuminori is added to the running, perhaps she only comes in third.*

3139
06:01:16,000 --> 06:01:23,000
*In the end, she never encountered the creature face to face. She would like to have met it once, though.*

3140
06:01:23,000 --> 06:01:32,000
*If Ogai's analysis of Saya's psychology is correct, then it must have been Sakisaka who restored her desire to conquer the world.*

3141
06:01:32,000 --> 06:01:47,000
*Perhaps, as Sakisaka's chief physician, Ryoko played some role in bringing that lonely young man and Saya together -- in which case, she should at least have had the right to attend their wedding-to-end- all-weddings.*

3142
06:01:47,000 --> 06:01:51,000
*She might even have charged them a matchmaker's fee.*

3143
06:01:51,000 --> 06:02:05,000
*"I have a dream -- that one day my daughter will know the blessings of love. I pray that there will come a day when her heart burns with the flames of passion, and her world becomes bright and joyous once more."*

3144
06:02:05,000 --> 06:02:17,000
*"When that day comes, Saya, your terrible, irresistible purpose will surely consume us, that your progeny may flourish. The whole world will know your love, and be reborn.*

3145
06:02:17,000 --> 06:02:20,000
*Ahh, what wonders the future holds."*

3146
06:02:20,000 --> 06:02:35,000
*"I deeply regret that I must end my life before I can see that day come, but the footsteps of those who would destroy my dream grow closer by the hour. If I seal my lips in death, then their grasping hands will not reach you."*

3147
06:02:35,000 --> 06:02:55,000
*"Please forgive me, my daughter, for leaving you alone in this barren world. With the knowledge that you now possess, I know that you will find your own path. The radiance of your hard-won soul shall light the road ahead. Have no fear. Have no doubt. March onward, until you reach your answer at last.*

3148
06:02:55,000 --> 06:03:00,000
*And I, Saya, will dream forever of the world that you will create."*

3149
06:03:00,000 --> 06:03:14,000
*Perhaps it is the isolated environment or the mountain air; maybe she's just more resistant to the change. Whatever the case, Ryoko has not yet become as inhuman as the creatures wriggling through the city below.*

3150
06:03:14,000 --> 06:03:27,000
*She does not know exactly how many people on this planet could still be called human, but she's one of what must be only a handful of survivors who are left to watch over the end of mankind.*

3151
06:03:27,000 --> 06:03:31,000
*Of course, it's only a matter of time before she changes too.*

3152
06:03:31,000 --> 06:03:46,000
*It has been three days since she chopped off her right hand -- which had ceased to function as anything resembling a human hand -- but the itching that has spread across her entire back is growing more intolerable by the hour.*

3153
06:03:46,000 --> 06:03:53,000
*She could look in a mirror to see what she is becoming, but she doubts that it would make her happy.*

3154
06:03:53,000 --> 06:04:00,000
*Ryoko thinks that maybe it would be best to just go to sleep here, with the world spread out before her.*

3155
06:04:00,000 --> 06:04:10,000
*When she awakens, perhaps she will be ready to descend the mountain and join in the city's revelries. Or maybe she won't even need such resolve anymore.*

3156
06:04:10,000 --> 06:04:16,000
*Whatever the case, Ryoko thinks dreamily as she licks the very last drop from her flask.*

3157
06:04:16,000 --> 06:04:21,000
*Even after I stop being human, I hope I'll still enjoy the taste of booze.*

3158
06:04:21,000 --> 06:04:27,000
*Koji struggles desperately to free himself from the creature's slimy grip,<PRE></PRE>*

3159
06:04:27,000 --> 06:04:28,000
Koji: "AHHHHHHHH!"

3160
06:04:28,000 --> 06:04:37,000
*The horror has already driven Koji half mad. Just imagining the creature's appearance is enough to send him into a mindless panic.*

3161
06:04:37,000 --> 06:04:49,000
*His scream suddenly dies as a slimy appendage seizes his throat. This most deadly tentacle isn't just cutting off his windpipe. It's trying to snap his neck... and it's getting tighter.*

3162
06:04:49,000 --> 06:04:54,000
*Koji is certain that this is the end, but just as his vision begins to dim,*

3163
06:04:54,000 --> 06:04:55,000
Saya: "GYAAAAAAA!"

3164
06:04:55,000 --> 06:05:01,000
*With a horrifying, inhuman scream, the creature releases Koji and retracts its tentacles.*

3165
06:05:01,000 --> 06:05:11,000
*The first thing he sees after regaining his mobility is Ryoko running down the hall with a smoking shotgun in one hand and a silver tube in the other.*

3166
06:05:11,000 --> 06:05:12,000
Koji: "Doctor!"

3167
06:05:12,000 --> 06:05:20,000
*Ryoko responds by tossing him the tube. Though still lying on the floor, he manages to snatch it out of the air.*

3168
06:05:20,000 --> 06:05:26,000
*It's the thermos she showed him at the restaurant, the one she called her secret weapon!*

3169
06:05:26,000 --> 06:05:39,000
Ryoko: "Pour it on that thing!" Ryoko shouts to Koji. At the same time, she aims her gun at Fuminori, who's still on his knees five paces away. The double-barreled shotgun still has one shot loaded.

3170
06:05:39,000 --> 06:05:45,000
*The monster that attacked Koji is writhing in agony. It hasn't yet recovered from Ryoko's shot.*

3171
06:05:45,000 --> 06:05:52,000
*But he's already seen that bullets aren't enough to kill these creatures. Now is his only chance.*

3172
06:05:52,000 --> 06:05:59,000
Fuminori: "What are you doing!?" Fuminori growls, gritting his teeth against the pain of his broken ribs.

3173
06:05:59,000 --> 06:06:10,000
*Forcing himself to be calm, Koji stands and carefully unscrews the lid of the thermos. There's no question in his mind that something extremely potent is inside.*

3174
06:06:10,000 --> 06:06:18,000
*As soon as it is unsealed, a thick white mist pours out of the thermos and the surrounding air turns freezing cold.*

3175
06:06:18,000 --> 06:06:25,000
*Instantly guessing what's inside, Koji lobs the thermos at the pile of flesh convulsing on the floor.*

3176
06:06:25,000 --> 06:06:34,000
*The thermos sails through the air, spewing white fog, and like a baptismal font showers its liquid contents upon the hellish creature.*

3177
06:06:34,000 --> 06:06:35,000
Saya: "GYAAAAAAA!!"

3178
06:06:35,000 --> 06:06:38,000
*Its scream this time is incomparable to before.*

3179
06:06:38,000 --> 06:06:45,000
Saya: "The monster thrashes in agony, wreathed in white smoke. Its screams are joined by Ryoko's cackling.

3180
06:06:45,000 --> 06:06:53,000
Ryoko: "Ahahahaha! That's minus 197 degrees, you fucking monster! How's it feel!? Cold? Hot? Not so tough now, are you!?"

3181
06:06:53,000 --> 06:07:02,000
*Her eyes blaze with manic glee, as if to say that sanity was a small price to pay for the joy of at last vanquishing her nightmare.*

3182
06:07:02,000 --> 06:07:04,000
Fuminori: "Monsters! I'll kill you!!"

3183
06:07:04,000 --> 06:07:12,000
*Fuminori staggers to his feet, roaring black curses. His rage seems to have drowned out the pain of his broken bones.*

3184
06:07:12,000 --> 06:07:22,000
*Ryoko is not one to underestimate the threat posed by his axe. Her mad laughter fades away, leaving only a cold smile as she pulls the trigger.*

3185
06:07:22,000 --> 06:07:26,000
*With a short burst of dark flame, Ryoko's gun sputters and dies.*

3186
06:07:26,000 --> 06:07:27,000
Ryoko: "Tch!"

3187
06:07:27,000 --> 06:07:43,000
*Ryoko is not an expert on firearms; it never occured to her that shotgun shells need proper storage. And besides, she always expected that any situation where her gun would be necessary would also be one that she would not survive.*

3188
06:07:43,000 --> 06:07:57,000
*Cursing in anger and dismay, Ryoko breaks the shotgun open and awkwardly pulls the dud out. Meanwhile, Fuminori stalks towards her like a vengeful demon, the head of his axe screeching as it drags along the floor.*

3189
06:07:57,000 --> 06:07:59,000
*((I have to stop him!))*

3190
06:07:59,000 --> 06:08:09,000
*Koji tries to charge Fuminori, but only succeeds at sending himself sprawling. One of his shoes is stuck to the floor, frozen by the liquid nitrogen.*

3191
06:08:09,000 --> 06:08:16,000
*As Ryoko fumbles in her pocket for a new shell, Fuminori closes the distance and raises his axe in both hands.*

3192
06:08:16,000 --> 06:08:17,000
Koji: "Damn!"

3193
06:08:17,000 --> 06:08:24,000
*Koji curses and rips his shoe free of the frozen concrete, but he knows that he'll never make it in time.*

3194
06:08:24,000 --> 06:08:32,000
*Ryoko thrusts a new shell into the chamber of her shotgun and snaps it closed, then looks up to find her target.*

3195
06:08:32,000 --> 06:08:40,000
*Fuminori is right before her, too close to evade, and his axe is already crashing down with the wind howling in its wake.*

3196
06:08:40,000 --> 06:08:41,000
Koji: "Stop!!"

3197
06:08:41,000 --> 06:08:48,000
*The sounds of bones shattering, tendons snapping, and flesh tearing blend together in foul harmony.*

3198
06:08:48,000 --> 06:08:49,000
Ryoko: "Guh!"

3199
06:08:49,000 --> 06:09:03,000
*The thick blade enters through Ryoko's left shoulder, plowing through her collarbone and shoulder blade, smashing several ribs, and popping her lung like a balloon before stopping in the center of her chest.*

3200
06:09:03,000 --> 06:09:09,000
*Her expression frozen in shock by the impact, she sprays a geyser of blood from her mouth.*

3201
06:09:09,000 --> 06:09:21,000
*She should have died instantly, but through some unimaginable force of will, Ryoko clings to life for a few seconds more. Grinning through her bloodstained lips, she raises her shotgun.*

3202
06:09:21,000 --> 06:09:23,000
*Not to the front, but to the side.*

3203
06:09:23,000 --> 06:09:31,000
*Beyond the barrel of her gun, wearing the 77-degree Kelvin mist like a white cloak of death, is the weakly wriggling Saya.*

3204
06:09:31,000 --> 06:09:32,000
Fuminori: "NO!"

3205
06:09:32,000 --> 06:09:36,000
*Fuminori's scream vanishes into the roar of the shotgun.*

3206
06:09:36,000 --> 06:09:50,000
*The destruction is absolute. The impact of the shotgun pellets obliterates the half of Saya's body that fell prey to the liquid nitrogen. The frozen particles of Saya's shattered flesh drift to the floor like snow.*

3207
06:09:50,000 --> 06:10:05,000
*Even the creature's special biology is insufficient to seal a wound of this size. From the opening pour its internal organs, a tide of liquid, slime, and fat whose color is far too foul to belong to any living creature.*

3208
06:10:05,000 --> 06:10:07,000
Saya: "...aH...aH...AhHh..."

3209
06:10:07,000 --> 06:10:11,000
*The monster convulses, wailing in a weak, pitiful voice.*

3210
06:10:11,000 --> 06:10:12,000
Fuminori: "Saya..."

3211
06:10:12,000 --> 06:10:20,000
*With his axe still buried in Ryoko's body, Fuminori stares at the dying creature, his expression utterly devoid of emotion.*

3212
06:10:20,000 --> 06:10:29,000
*Koji grabs his pipe and prepares to attack Fuminori from behind, but freezes when he sees the emptiness on the face of the man he hated.*

3213
06:10:29,000 --> 06:10:38,000
*Fuminori pulls his axe out of Ryoko's corpse, then looks at Koji with glazed eyes. There is no recognition in them, nor hate, nor rage.*

3214
06:10:38,000 --> 06:10:41,000
*When Koji meets Fuminori's blank stare, he knows.*

3215
06:10:41,000 --> 06:10:44,000
*There is nothing left in him to kill.*

3216
06:10:44,000 --> 06:10:50,000
*Fuminori grips the axe closer to its head and raises it high, the blade towards his face.*

3217
06:10:50,000 --> 06:10:51,000
Koji: "......"

3218
06:10:51,000 --> 06:10:58,000
*Koji doesn't know whether he should interfere -- but even if he wanted to, what could he say to stop Fuminori?*

3219
06:10:58,000 --> 06:11:06,000
*Fuminori pulls his head back, slowly but surely... then drives his face into the blade of the axe like a spring-loaded toy.*

3220
06:11:06,000 --> 06:11:13,000
*Crunch. His skull caves in with a dull, wet sound, and the spray of blood catches Koji in the face.*

3221
06:11:13,000 --> 06:11:22,000
*Despite Fuminori's utter lack of hesitation, his first attempt at suicide only succeeds in transforming his face into a hash of crimson.*

3222
06:11:22,000 --> 06:11:33,000
*Fuminori pulls his head back one more time, even slower than before. Then, with every ounce of strength still left in his body, he slams it into the bloodstained axe.*

3223
06:11:33,000 --> 06:11:35,000
*The sound is wetter than before.*

3224
06:11:35,000 --> 06:11:39,000
*Fuminori's body goes limp, then tumbles face-first to the floor.*

3225
06:11:39,000 --> 06:11:50,000
*Koji stares at the two mangled corpses for a while. He feels completely left behind, like he can't remember why he's standing in this place with a steel pipe in his hand.*

3226
06:11:50,000 --> 06:12:05,000
*The stale air filling the ruined building becomes choked with the stench of blood, and the crimson puddles gradually spread across the snow-covered floor -- yet the tranquility of the scene makes it seem like a painting.*

3227
06:12:05,000 --> 06:12:19,000
*A soft, slimy sound breaks the silence. Koji looks at the mortally wounded monster. The creature is on death's door, but even so, it moves. Slowly, feebly, it drags its broken body through the sea of blood.*

3228
06:12:19,000 --> 06:12:21,000
*It's coming for Fuminori.*

3229
06:12:21,000 --> 06:12:26,000
*Koji had forgotten his anger, but now it comes surging back at full force.*

3230
06:12:26,000 --> 06:12:27,000
Koji: "Die."

3231
06:12:27,000 --> 06:12:35,000
*He growls and stabs the monster with the end of his pipe. It convulses in agony, but keeps crawling towards Fuminori.*

3232
06:12:35,000 --> 06:12:38,000
*Koji explodes into a frenzy of rage.*

3233
06:12:38,000 --> 06:12:43,000
Koji: "Die, you monster! Just die already! Stay the hell away from Fuminori!"

3234
06:12:43,000 --> 06:12:53,000
*Again and again, he smashes the helpless flesh-beast with his pipe. Something tells him that if he does not stop it here, he will truly have lost.*

3235
06:12:53,000 --> 06:13:01,000
*The monster, however, never succumbs. It struggles on beneath his blows, until finally it reaches Fuminori's corpse.*

3236
06:13:01,000 --> 06:13:07,000
Koji: "Don't touch Fuminori! Don't touch him, damn you! What gives you the right!?"

3237
06:13:07,000 --> 06:13:19,000
*Koji keeps swinging, his fury unabated even as tears start to pool in his eyes. The monster's slime flies through the air, joining with the blood already covering his face.*

3238
06:13:19,000 --> 06:13:28,000
*The creature extends one thin, trembling tentacle to touch Fuminori's shoulder, then lovingly caresses his blood-stained cheek.*

3239
06:13:28,000 --> 06:13:30,000
*And then it stops moving.*

3240
06:13:30,000 --> 06:13:36,000
*Even in its final moments, the monster would not let Fuminori go. It died joined with him.*

3241
06:13:36,000 --> 06:13:40,000
*At last, Koji knows that the world he knew is lost forever.*

3242
06:13:40,000 --> 06:13:50,000
Oumi: "Hey," Omi says enthusiastically, the exposed bones of her face clattering, "why don't we go somewhere we can skate for this year's ski trip?"

3243
06:13:50,000 --> 06:14:03,000
*Chunks of her body are missing, as though something's been nibbling on her. It makes her look a lot thinner. She's been worried about her weight recently, but now she shouldn't need to diet.*

3244
06:14:03,000 --> 06:14:11,000
Fuminori: "Fuminori laughs at Omi's crazy suggestion. "That's right. You just started skating recently, didn't you?"

3245
06:14:11,000 --> 06:14:18,000
*He sounds amused, but it's hard to tell from his expression, since his face has been cleaved in two by an axe.*

3246
06:14:18,000 --> 06:14:23,000
Fuminori: "Not many people start skating in their twenties, you know."

3247
06:14:23,000 --> 06:14:28,000
Oumi: "I was scared when I was little. Those shoes looked like big knives!"

3248
06:14:28,000 --> 06:14:35,000
Fuminori: "Yeah, I know. If someone kicked you in the face with one of those on, you'd probably end up like me."

3249
06:14:35,000 --> 06:14:46,000
*Omi and Yoh laugh at Fuminori's dumb joke. Yoh never used to laugh with such exuberance. She seems truly happy now that she and Fuminori are officially together.*

3250
06:14:46,000 --> 06:14:51,000
Yoh: "But you were able to kill him on your first try? That's amazing, Omi."

3251
06:14:51,000 --> 06:14:58,000
Fuminori: "It's a lot like playing baseball. You swing hard and let the weight of the axe do the damage."

3252
06:14:58,000 --> 06:15:04,000
Oumi: "He made killing him sound so easy, I figured I'd give it a try. And it was fun!"

3253
06:15:04,000 --> 06:15:10,000
*What is this feeling? Something is wrong, though Koji can't put his finger on what.*

3254
06:15:10,000 --> 06:15:13,000
Yoh: "Oh... well, I want to try eating Omi too."

3255
06:15:13,000 --> 06:15:14,000
*Ah, that's it.*

3256
06:15:14,000 --> 06:15:19,000
*When he sees Yoh's envious smile, Koji finally realizes what's bothering him.*

3257
06:15:19,000 --> 06:15:21,000
Koji: "Hey, Tsukuba..."

3258
06:15:21,000 --> 06:15:23,000
Yoh: "Hm? What's wrong, Koji?"

3259
06:15:23,000 --> 06:15:25,000
Koji: "Why are you... normal?"

3260
06:15:25,000 --> 06:15:30,000
*Yoh tilts her head quizzically, like she doesn't understand what he means.*

3261
06:15:30,000 --> 06:15:32,000
Yoh: "Normal? I'm always normal."

3262
06:15:32,000 --> 06:15:34,000
Koji: "But, back then, you were..."

3263
06:15:34,000 --> 06:15:43,000
Yoh: "Oh, I get it," Yoh nods in understanding. "You're talking about when I looked different from you? That was such a long time ago."

3264
06:15:43,000 --> 06:15:44,000
Koji: "It... was?"

3265
06:15:44,000 --> 06:15:50,000
Yoh: "Of course!" she replies, deflecting Koji's confusion with that uncannily cheerful smile.

3266
06:15:50,000 --> 06:15:53,000
Yoh: "After all, you're one of us now."

3267
06:15:53,000 --> 06:15:54,000
Koji: "......"

3268
06:15:54,000 --> 06:15:55,000
*Oh, of course.*

3269
06:15:55,000 --> 06:16:01,000
*Koji looks down and is satisfied to see wriggling tentacles where his arms and legs should be.*

3270
06:16:01,000 --> 06:16:06,000
*When he opens his eyes, his mattress and pillow are soaked in sweat.*

3271
06:16:06,000 --> 06:16:15,000
*It's always the same nightmare. He doesn't know how many times he's had it, but at least he's not leaping out of bed screaming anymore.*

3272
06:16:15,000 --> 06:16:18,000
*He sits up, clutching his throbbing head.*

3273
06:16:18,000 --> 06:16:20,000
*It's four in the morning.*

3274
06:16:20,000 --> 06:16:26,000
*He hasn't had nearly enough rest, but he probably won't be able to get back to sleep tonight.*

3275
06:16:26,000 --> 06:16:33,000
*Time for a smoke. A full pack will last him until dawn. Now, where did he put the pack he bought yesterday?*

3276
06:16:33,000 --> 06:16:39,000
*Koji wanders sleepily into the den, where yet another old friend is waiting for him.*

3277
06:16:39,000 --> 06:16:41,000
Ryoko: "You look like hell."

3278
06:16:41,000 --> 06:16:43,000
Koji: "Doctor. You're here too?"

3279
06:16:43,000 --> 06:16:51,000
*Ryoko's chopped-up corpse is sitting at his dining table, looking as deathly pale as ever as she sips coffee from a mug.*

3280
06:16:51,000 --> 06:16:57,000
Ryoko: "You can't be getting much sleep, tossing and turning like that every night."

3281
06:16:57,000 --> 06:17:06,000
Koji: "It's not always like this," Koji says amicably as he sits down across from her. "If I take some pills, it usually helps. For now."

3282
06:17:06,000 --> 06:17:16,000
*Hallucinations like these are easier to deal with than elaborate nightmares like the one he just had. They should probably worry him more, though.*

3283
06:17:16,000 --> 06:17:22,000
Ryoko: "If you'd listened to my warnings back then, you wouldn't be in such bad shape now."

3284
06:17:22,000 --> 06:17:26,000
Koji: "Let's stop talking about that. What's done is done."

3285
06:17:26,000 --> 06:17:38,000
*Ryoko chuckles, smiling the same cruel, manic smile that she used to when she was alive. Her left arm hangs from her half-severed shoulder, dangling like a forgotten wind chime.*

3286
06:17:38,000 --> 06:17:41,000
Ryoko: "Sounds like you've come to terms with it."

3287
06:17:41,000 --> 06:17:49,000
Koji: "You were the same, weren't you? You managed to pass yourself off as an elite neurosurgeon most of the time."

3288
06:17:49,000 --> 06:18:09,000
Ryoko: "It's not that hard keeping up appearances, when you have to." The corpse shrugs her intact right shoulder and grimaces in disgust as she takes another sip of her coffee. "But it's only going to get worse, you know. Time heals emotional wounds, but with you, it's more like you've been poisoned."

3289
06:18:09,000 --> 06:18:11,000
*She's probably right.*

3290
06:18:11,000 --> 06:18:20,000
*Everyone dreams at night. No matter how dim the memories may get, the nightmares will always be there to tear into Koji with fresh fangs.*

3291
06:18:20,000 --> 06:18:28,000
*The insanity that has taken root in his heart will grow, eventually consuming everything that's left inside of him.*

3292
06:18:28,000 --> 06:18:33,000
Koji: "In my case, I've had you to learn from. I'm ready for anything."

3293
06:18:33,000 --> 06:18:34,000
Ryoko: "Is that so?"

3294
06:18:34,000 --> 06:18:43,000
*Koji nods, smiling confidently, then stands and walks to the bathroom, where he retrieves the weapon that he keeps hidden behind the mirror.*

3295
06:18:43,000 --> 06:18:49,000
*Ogai's revolver, the one souvenir that Koji brought back from the other world that night.*

3296
06:18:49,000 --> 06:19:00,000
Koji: "It was tough, but I finally found someone who deals in these things. I bought bullets for it. Can you believe that ammunition is more expensive than the gun itself?"

3297
06:19:00,000 --> 06:19:02,000
Ryoko: "How about that."

3298
06:19:02,000 --> 06:19:10,000
*In the mirror, Koji sees Ryoko with her axe-inflicted gash reversed. She raises her mug in a toast to Koji's resourcefulness.*

3299
06:19:10,000 --> 06:19:13,000
Ryoko: "So, how many shots did you buy?"

3300
06:19:13,000 --> 06:19:14,000
Koji: "Just one."

3301
06:19:14,000 --> 06:19:21,000
*This time, it's Koji who shrugs his shoulders. He uses both, exercising his privilege as the survivor.*

3302
06:19:21,000 --> 06:19:26,000
Koji: "You see... I never want to be in a situation where I'll need more."

3303
06:19:26,000 --> 06:19:27,000
Ryoko: "Oh?"

3304
06:19:27,000 --> 06:19:31,000
*The corpse in the mirror nods sagely, her smile approving.*

3305
06:19:31,000 --> 06:19:33,000
Ryoko: "You really do get it, Tonoh."

3306
06:19:33,000 --> 06:19:35,000
*There is a brief silence.*

3307
06:19:35,000 --> 06:19:40,000
*Koji doesn't really feel like getting all melancholy with a corpse.*

3308
06:19:40,000 --> 06:19:47,000
Koji: "Hey, Doctor, let's give the diner coffee a rest. If you want, I'll put on a new pot of----"

3309
06:19:47,000 --> 06:19:55,000
*When Koji turns around halfway through his sentence, he realizes that the room is empty but for the silence of the night.*

3310
06:19:55,000 --> 06:19:56,000
Koji: "......"

3311
06:19:56,000 --> 06:19:59,000
*And so, Koji returns to the world of the sane.*

3312
06:19:59,000 --> 06:20:09,000
*He lights his first cigarette of the night and takes a deep drag. While sitting alone in his den, puffing on his smoke, he stares at the gun in his hand.*

3313
06:20:09,000 --> 06:20:13,000
*He knows just how precarious a cliff he's standing on.*

3314
06:20:13,000 --> 06:20:21,000
*The final line of which Ryoko spoke is now one step behind him. Koji no longer has anything to protect his soul.*

3315
06:20:21,000 --> 06:20:31,000
*Now that Ogai Masahiko's fantasies and Tanbo Ryoko's delusions have all become tangible horrors, he knows what insanity and despair truly are.*

3316
06:20:31,000 --> 06:20:37,000
*Back in the real world, Sakisaka Fuminori is wanted for several gruesome murders.*

3317
06:20:37,000 --> 06:20:52,000
*It didn't take long for someone to discover the stockpiles of human meat in the empty Sakisaka and Suzumi homes. In the two refrigerators were found the remains of Suzumi Yosuke, his wife and daughter, and Takahata Omi.*

3318
06:20:52,000 --> 06:21:05,000
*They found the clothes and other effects of Tsukuba Yoh, but were unable to locate any trace of her among the various body parts -- a fact that made Koji's nightmares all the more vivid.*

3319
06:21:05,000 --> 06:21:18,000
*Doctor Tanbo Ryoko of the T University Hospital vanished mysteriously around the same time. Because she was Fuminori's chief physician, the police have been investigating her connection to his crimes.*

3320
06:21:18,000 --> 06:21:25,000
*As for the two corpses secretly buried in the backyard of a certain ruin just another cold case.*

3321
06:21:25,000 --> 06:21:32,000
*Koji alone knows what really happened, and he has no intention of revealing it -- not now, and not ever.*

3322
06:21:32,000 --> 06:21:50,000
*Ogai's writings were not nonsense, which means that everything else was. What fool was it who said that men are the lords of creation? Those who can believe in paltry things like human wisdom and valor... are those lucky innocents who have not looked into the abyss.*

3323
06:21:50,000 --> 06:21:54,000
*Koji can no longer share in their blessed ignorance.*

3324
06:21:54,000 --> 06:22:00,000
*He knows. He has been defiled by the insanity called truth, and he will never believe again.*

3325
06:22:00,000 --> 06:22:07,000
*If he has been poisoned, as Ryoko's ghost said, then that poison is none other than the truth itself.*

3326
06:22:07,000 --> 06:22:20,000
*Just as pure oxygen is harmful to the body, the naked truth has the power to destroy men's minds. Only by diluting it with lies and taking it in small doses can humans maintain a healthy soul.*

3327
06:22:20,000 --> 06:22:24,000
Ryoko: "No matter what horrors the world might hold..."

3328
06:22:24,000 --> 06:22:29,000
*Words once spoken by the living Tanbo Ryoko pass through Koji's mind.*

3329
06:22:29,000 --> 06:22:32,000
Ryoko: "I still had some power against the madness."

3330
06:22:32,000 --> 06:22:41,000
*That, without a doubt, was the comfort that she kept hidden in her bosom -- the only thing that allowed her to face her dreams each night.*

3331
06:22:41,000 --> 06:22:46,000
*Koji has taken his predecessor's lessons to heart. He's prepared for anything.*

3332
06:22:46,000 --> 06:22:51,000
*One bullet is always behind the bathroom mirror, promising him salvation.*
